Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.20,0:01:09.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's time to wake up
Dialogue: 2,0:01:07.20,0:01:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,快从睡梦中醒来
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.32,0:01:13.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,and get a life.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:11.32,0:01:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,体验精彩的人生
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.48,0:01:15.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,We live in a three-dimensional world.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.48,0:01:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们活在一个立体世界
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.08,0:01:18.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Until now, the world of computing has been a flat world
Dialogue: 2,0:01:16.08,0:01:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但是目前的电脑科技
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.52,0:01:20.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,consisting of two-dimensional imageiy.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.52,0:01:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,只能呈现平面影像
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.96,0:01:24.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, through the use of exclusive,breakthrough technology,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:20.96,0:01:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,现在透过突破性独家科技
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.16,0:01:27.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,ARC has made it possible for you to get a life.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:24.16,0:01:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,艾科电脑将让您活得更精采
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.68,0:01:29.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,A-Life, where we can work and play
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.68,0:01:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,拥有丰富人生
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.08,0:01:33.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,in a lifelike world of three-dimensional reality.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:30.08,0:01:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,在逼真的世界里工作及玩乐
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.52,0:01:35.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,A-Life, the living monitor.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:33.52,0:01:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一个栩栩如生的电脑荧幕
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.36,0:01:38.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,Impressed?
Dialogue: 2,0:01:37.36,0:01:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.24,0:01:43.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:41.24,0:01:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,很喜欢
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.36,0:01:46.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you put one of those in a box for me?
Dialogue: 2,0:01:43.36,0:01:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,请你帮我包起来
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.52,0:02:00.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Are you the lawyer? - I'm Rita Dunne.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:57.52,0:02:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是律师吗？- 我是邓莉担
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.08,0:02:03.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Obviously, no one from Nexim could be here today.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:01.08,0:02:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,耐鑫电脑的主管不会来
Dialogue: 2,0:02:05.60,0:02:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,片名：记忆裂痕
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.04,0:02:21.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,- I'd invite you in, but... - Good luck, Mr Jennings.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:17.04,0:02:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我很想请你进来 但… - 祝好运 詹先生
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.20,0:02:23.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,- I'll see you in two months. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:21.20,0:02:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 两个月后见 - 好
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.04,0:02:30.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Home, sweet home.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.04,0:02:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,甜蜜的家
Dialogue: 2,0:03:19.20,0:03:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,"上载中"
Dialogue: 2,0:03:28.72,0:03:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,"扫描资料库"
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.76,0:04:12.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:10.76,0:04:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.92,0:04:16.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is the exact same technology?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:12.92,0:04:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一模一样的产品？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.32,0:04:18.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,Not the exact same technology, no.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:16.32,0:04:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是一模一样
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.36,0:04:20.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, I decided to reconceive some of it.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:18.36,0:04:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,后来我决定重新设计
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.88,0:04:23.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,I never liked the way the monitor looked.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:20.88,0:04:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢荧幕的造型
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.88,0:04:28.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,And then it occurred to me, who needs it?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:23.88,0:04:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,后来突然想到 谁需要它呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.28,0:04:33.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, I am the future of computing.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:30.28,0:04:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 我是电脑的未来
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.12,0:04:34.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,And I would like to present you
Dialogue: 2,0:04:33.12,0:04:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我要向您介绍
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.56,0:04:37.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,with Nexim's new Freedom ilne of display technology.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:34.56,0:04:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,全新的自由型显示器科技
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.00,0:04:41.54,Eng,,0,0,0,,New from Nexim. Freedom is in your future.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:38.00,0:04:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,耐鑫电脑 未来就在您眼前
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.48,0:04:52.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,Launch this now. ARC is not gonna last.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:48.48,0:04:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,立刻上市 艾科完蛋了
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.20,0:04:54.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,Who said 100% market share was impossible?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:52.20,0:04:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会拥有百分百市场占有率
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.52,0:04:56.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,Get me Marketing immediately.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:54.52,0:04:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我接行销部
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.00,0:04:59.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,This far exceeds our expectations.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:57.00,0:04:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这远远超出我们的期望
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.80,0:05:07.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:05.80,0:05:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜了
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.72,0:05:14.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:11.72,0:05:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.40,0:05:19.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,You understand, Mr Jennings, you've just done in two months
Dialogue: 2,0:05:16.40,0:05:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,詹先生 你要知道 你两个月
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.44,0:05:22.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,what we've been trying to do for three years.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:19.44,0:05:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,就完成到三年的工作
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.32,0:05:25.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it's easier if you work backwards.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:22.32,0:05:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候逆向思考比较有用
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.52,0:05:28.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:27.52,0:05:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.24,0:05:46.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,You won't remember me, will you?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:43.24,0:05:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会记得我 对吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.64,0:05:49.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:46.64,0:05:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.44,0:05:50.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:49.44,0:05:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,真可惜
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.00,0:06:24.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Marker reached.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:23.00,0:06:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,找到记忆定点
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.60,0:06:42.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:41.60,0:06:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.04,0:06:48.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,We're now extracting his memory from the marker forward to the present.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:44.04,0:06:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要消除他从定点到现在的记忆
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.60,0:07:21.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,Jesus, Rita.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:19.60,0:07:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 莉担
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.44,0:07:26.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 2,0:07:24.44,0:07:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,老天爷
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.12,0:07:28.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is dangerous enough.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:27.12,0:07:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这已经够危险了
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.60,0:07:35.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,If this man's brain temp goes one above 43, he's a veg.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:30.60,0:07:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他的大脑温度超过43摄氏度就会变成植物人
Dialogue: 2,0:07:36.32,0:07:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,"危险"
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.20,0:07:43.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mike.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:41.20,0:07:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 迈可
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.00,0:07:55.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:54.00,0:07:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:01.32,0:08:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,"记忆消除"
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.80,0:08:07.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's all clean.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:06.80,0:08:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,都消除了
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.64,0:08:15.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,Good morning, sunshine.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:12.64,0:08:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,早安 老弟
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.76,0:08:17.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, how you doing, big guy?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:15.76,0:08:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.08,0:08:19.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:18.08,0:08:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,行吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.24,0:08:21.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,All right. Thank you. Take it easy.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:19.24,0:08:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢 别紧张
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.40,0:08:23.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Slow, slow, slow. There's no hurry, okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:21.40,0:08:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢来 不用急
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.16,0:08:29.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,- That's it. Good? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:26.16,0:08:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 没事吗？- 没事
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.92,0:08:32.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,Good man. Hey, Mike, look at me.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:29.92,0:08:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 看着我
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.64,0:08:33.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,Look at me. Right here.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:32.64,0:08:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我的眼睛
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.76,0:08:38.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,What's the last date you remember?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:35.76,0:08:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你记得的最后一天？
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.44,0:08:42.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,- October 19. - Very good.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:39.44,0:08:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 十月十九日 - 非常好
Dialogue: 2,0:08:42.16,0:08:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"十二月二十二日"
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.60,0:08:46.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,Mike, what's the last thing you remember?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:43.60,0:08:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 你记得的最后一件事？
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.12,0:08:51.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,The Red Sox rnade the playoffs.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:50.12,0:08:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,红袜队打入季后赛
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.04,0:08:56.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's get the legal out of the way, shall we?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:53.04,0:08:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,先解决法律问题吧
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.40,0:09:01.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr Michael Jennings, under the terms of your non-disclosure agreement,
Dialogue: 2,0:08:57.40,0:09:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,詹迈可先生 根据你的保密协议
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.68,0:09:04.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,you are considered never to have been an employee.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:01.68,0:09:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来不是本公司员工
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.92,0:09:10.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,You also understand that all your work is the intellectual property of Nexim...
Dialogue: 2,0:09:04.92,0:09:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你也同意你的设计是耐鑫电脑智慧财产
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.28,0:09:12.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:10.28,0:09:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 是的 是的 是的
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.60,0:09:14.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,I never worked here. I never saw anybody.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:12.60,0:09:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我没在这儿工作 谁也没见到
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.32,0:09:16.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,I never was here. I got it.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:14.32,0:09:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,算我没来过 我了解啦
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.20,0:09:17.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Is my paycheque ready?
Dialogue: 2,0:09:16.20,0:09:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我的酬劳呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.80,0:09:27.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,All righty.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:26.80,0:09:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.44,0:09:31.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,- How you feeling, tiger? - Good.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:28.44,0:09:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你感觉如何？- 棒呆了
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.28,0:09:33.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Now let's hear you. -All right.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:31.28,0:09:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那就来吧 - 好的
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.04,0:09:36.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Ready? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:34.04,0:09:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了吗？-好了
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.36,0:09:38.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:37.36,0:09:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,开始
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.36,0:09:47.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,In order to zero the full eight weeks, I had to heat your brain to 42.5.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:43.36,0:09:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我为了消除两个月的记忆 把你的脑温升到42.5度
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.52,0:09:50.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,- I'm fine. - I'm saying it's getting harder, Mike.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:47.52,0:09:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我很好 - 这愈来愈危险了
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.60,0:09:51.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,I said I'm fine.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:50.60,0:09:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我说我很好
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.84,0:09:53.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're slowing down, actually. Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:51.84,0:09:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你的反应愈来愈慢
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.04,0:09:55.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd be a lot faster if you'd shut up.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:54.04,0:09:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,谁叫你一直碎碎念
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.92,0:09:58.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Show me what you've got, grasshopper.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:55.92,0:09:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那就露一手给我看吧
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.64,0:10:01.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's it. That's more like it!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:59.64,0:10:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 这才像话
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.60,0:10:05.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 2,0:10:01.60,0:10:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 来吧
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.64,0:10:06.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,Go! Go!
Dialogue: 2,0:10:05.64,0:10:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,来…来…
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.40,0:10:10.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes! Faster!
Dialogue: 2,0:10:08.40,0:10:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 更快一点
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.64,0:10:14.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,Beautiful!
Dialogue: 2,0:10:12.64,0:10:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,棒呆了
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.32,0:10:17.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes! One more! One more, Mikey!
Dialogue: 2,0:10:15.32,0:10:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一下
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.20,0:10:23.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, do you see how you did that? How you focused?
Dialogue: 2,0:10:21.20,0:10:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到你有多猛吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.72,0:10:27.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Yeah. I focused on your face. - Now, you know you love me.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:23.72,0:10:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我把注意力集中在你的脸上 - 现在 你知道你喜欢我了吧
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.12,0:10:30.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on. Come on. Don't be mean to the one who does everything for you.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:27.12,0:10:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是替你做牛做马
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.04,0:10:34.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you realise you've never once asked me what I see
Dialogue: 2,0:10:31.04,0:10:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗？你从没问过我
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.60,0:10:36.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,when I erase your memory?
Dialogue: 2,0:10:34.60,0:10:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,消除你什么记忆
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.52,0:10:40.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Basically, the last two months just never happened for you.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:36.52,0:10:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这两个月对你来说没发生过
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.68,0:10:42.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,What's to know? Twenty hours a day in a clean room
Dialogue: 2,0:10:40.68,0:10:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么好知道的？我日以继夜
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.80,0:10:44.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,ripping off one guy's idea for a computer,
Dialogue: 2,0:10:42.80,0:10:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,剽窃别人的创意
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.52,0:10:46.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,selling it to somebody else... You know.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:44.52,0:10:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,再卖给别家公司
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.56,0:10:48.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,What you do the last two months?
Dialogue: 2,0:10:46.56,0:10:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你这两个月又做了什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.68,0:10:50.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,You know what the last thing I remember is?
Dialogue: 2,0:10:48.68,0:10:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我记得什么吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.12,0:10:52.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,Driving in Spain in the Aston Martin,
Dialogue: 2,0:10:50.12,0:10:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,在西班牙开酷炫跑车
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.52,0:10:56.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,learning to dive in Belize with what's-her-name.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:52.52,0:10:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在贝里兹恩美女一起潜水
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.24,0:10:58.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,The seven-stadiums-in-seven-days trip. It's great.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:56.24,0:10:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,每天都过得很充实 棒呆了
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.08,0:11:01.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean, my memories are basically highlights.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:59.08,0:11:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我的回忆都是精采片段
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.88,0:11:06.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's good. It's a good life. The stuff you erase, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:02.88,0:11:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我的人生很精采 你消除的记忆并不重要
Dialogue: 2,0:11:45.00,0:11:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,"雷吉米贤伉俪"
Dialogue: 2,0:11:47.36,0:11:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,"耐鑫电脑推出立体显示器"
Dialogue: 2,0:11:54.12,0:11:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,"我看到新闻就猜你回家了"
Dialogue: 2,0:11:56.40,0:11:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,"你没借口不参加派对"
Dialogue: 2,0:11:58.64,0:12:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,"对了 红袜队输球"
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.60,0:12:14.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,What is it with guys like Rethrick?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:12.60,0:12:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这种有钱人是怎么搞的？
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.76,0:12:16.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,He's gotta have everything, huh?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:14.76,0:12:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他非得拥有一切吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.16,0:12:20.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, say what you want about Jimmy, he started AlIcom in his garage.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:16.16,0:12:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,吃不到葡萄别说葡萄酸 他也是白手起家
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.68,0:12:46.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait, wait. Don't you leave me alone.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:44.68,0:12:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 别把我丢下来
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.96,0:12:49.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,What? You'll be fine. Talk. Mingle.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:46.96,0:12:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,安啦 去跟他们交际应酬
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.20,0:12:55.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't want to mingle.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:53.20,0:12:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想交际应酬
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.00,0:13:01.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:00.00,0:13:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,哈喽
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.56,0:13:08.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm Michael.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:06.56,0:13:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我是迈可
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.56,0:13:10.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm Rachel.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:08.56,0:13:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我是蕾秋
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.08,0:13:12.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,Rachel Porter.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:11.08,0:13:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,卜蕾秋
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.72,0:13:15.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that Miss or Mrs.?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:12.72,0:13:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,卜小姐或卜太太？
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.84,0:13:20.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hmm. That would be Dr Porter.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:16.84,0:13:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我是卜博士
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.24,0:13:22.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Doctor. Well, excuse me, Doctor.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:20.24,0:13:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,博士哦 失敬了
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.52,0:13:24.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:23.52,0:13:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.84,0:13:27.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,What kind of a doctor are you?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:24.84,0:13:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么博士？
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.04,0:13:30.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,- I'm a biologist. - Really?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:28.04,0:13:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是生物学家 - 真的？
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.12,0:13:36.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you work for Jimmy?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:35.12,0:13:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你替吉米工作？
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.36,0:13:40.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,So it must be very top-secret biology that you practise.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:37.36,0:13:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你做的事一定要很保密
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.72,0:13:42.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. Isn't everything?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:40.72,0:13:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 不都是这样吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.88,0:13:51.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:48.88,0:13:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.24,0:13:52.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:51.24,0:13:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.84,0:13:57.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm happy to continue blathering on,
Dialogue: 2,0:13:52.84,0:13:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 我很乐意
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.48,0:13:58.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,trying helplessly to charm you,
Dialogue: 2,0:13:57.48,0:13:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你哈啦打屁
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.92,0:14:02.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,but I thought maybe, you know, cut to the chase and just,
Dialogue: 2,0:13:58.92,0:14:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我觉得不如省掉麻烦
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.44,0:14:04.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,you know, go somewhere.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:02.44,0:14:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,直接去别的地方
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.12,0:14:13.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what, Michael.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:11.12,0:14:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这样好了 迈可
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.92,0:14:17.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna walk over there and talk to a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:13.92,0:14:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我要过去跟朋友聊天
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.76,0:14:22.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,If you get the urge to have a real conversation,
Dialogue: 2,0:14:17.76,0:14:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,等你真的想认识我
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.40,0:14:24.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,you'll know where to find me.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:22.40,0:14:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,再来找我吧
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.80,0:14:29.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay. Fair enough.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:26.80,0:14:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 好极了
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.44,0:14:30.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,It was nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:29.44,0:14:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.96,0:14:35.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,Giving up so easily?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:32.96,0:14:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这么容易就放弃？
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.64,0:14:39.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't believe in second chances, now, do you?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:35.64,0:14:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你不相信有第二次机会？
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.80,0:14:42.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,In my experience, no, I don't.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:39.80,0:14:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,以我的经验通常没有
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.88,0:14:47.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Good night. - Good night.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:45.88,0:14:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 晚安 - 晚安
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.16,0:14:57.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Mike. - Jimmy.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:55.16,0:14:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 迈可 - 吉米
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.44,0:14:58.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,- How you doing? - Good. How you doing?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:57.44,0:14:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好吗？- 很好 你呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.92,0:15:00.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Good to see you. - You, too. You look good.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:58.92,0:15:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 见到你真好 - 我也是
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.32,0:15:01.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Thanks for coming. - Thanks for having me.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:00.32,0:15:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你能来 - 谢谢你的款待
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.68,0:15:03.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Come back this way. - Sure.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:01.68,0:15:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟我来 - 好的
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.28,0:15:04.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:03.28,0:15:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 吉米
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.20,0:15:13.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,Now you're talking. Thank you.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:11.20,0:15:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,棒呆了 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.64,0:15:17.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:15.64,0:15:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.56,0:15:20.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,Isaac, disable fire protection, please.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:17.56,0:15:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,电脑 解除防火措施
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.48,0:15:22.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Alarm disabled.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:21.48,0:15:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,警铃解除
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.00,0:15:29.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't think you'd look so good covered in foam. Even in that spiffy suit.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:26.00,0:15:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你可不想淋成落汤鸡 你穿了名牌西装
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.88,0:15:31.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,What's the pitch, Jimmy?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:29.88,0:15:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你找我有什么事？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.68,0:15:32.66,Eng,,0,0,0,,I've known you long enough to know
Dialogue: 2,0:15:31.68,0:15:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我太了解你
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.76,0:15:34.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,when you're trying to sell me something. What is it?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:32.76,0:15:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定有事找我
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.44,0:15:39.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, there was a time we were in school,
Dialogue: 2,0:15:36.44,0:15:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们念大学时有伟大抱负
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.52,0:15:41.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,we wanted to change the world.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:39.52,0:15:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想改变世界
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.52,0:15:43.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought we said we wanted to save the world.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:41.52,0:15:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我们想拯救世界
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.84,0:15:45.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that's semantics.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:43.84,0:15:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,说法不同而已
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.56,0:15:48.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,- What's the job, Jimmy? - Can't tell you
Dialogue: 2,0:15:45.56,0:15:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要我做什么？- 我不能说
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.40,0:15:50.96,Eng,,0,0,0,,other than to say that it involves optics.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:48.40,0:15:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能说跟光学有关
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.16,0:15:54.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,And you get stock options for this one, Mike.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:52.16,0:15:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这次你能分到股票
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.56,0:15:57.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Get a real piece of the company.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:54.56,0:15:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,当公司的股东
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.36,0:16:01.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,What if it doesn't work? I get a real piece of nothing.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:57.36,0:16:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,如果失败我啥都没有
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.28,0:16:02.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,I promise you, it won't fail.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:01.28,0:16:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证不会失败
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.88,0:16:07.26,Eng,,0,0,0,,How do you know that? Is this a real crystal ball?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:04.88,0:16:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你有能预知未来的水晶球吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.40,0:16:12.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,I wish. The point is, I'll guarantee that you do eight figures.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:07.40,0:16:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我真希望有 重点是我保证你能赚八位数
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.88,0:16:18.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Minimum. - What's the catch?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:14.88,0:16:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 至少 - 有什么条件？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.24,0:16:21.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,The job may require a little bit more time than you're used to.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:18.24,0:16:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这份工作的时间比以前久
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.60,0:16:24.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,- How much more time? - Two years, maybe three.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:21.60,0:16:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 多久？- 两年 也许三年
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.08,0:16:27.54,Eng,,0,0,0,,- You're kidding. - Deadly serious.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:25.08,0:16:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在开玩笑 - 我很认真
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.64,0:16:29.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Jimmy, it's impossible. You can't do it.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:27.64,0:16:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这是不可能的事 你不能这么做
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.00,0:16:31.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,The longest anyone has ever done is eight weeks.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:30.00,0:16:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我最多只能做八星期
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.56,0:16:32.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,I know, 'cause it was me.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:31.56,0:16:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 因为这是我
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.76,0:16:35.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Assuming it were possible, would you do it?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:32.76,0:16:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有可能你肯做吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.80,0:16:41.36,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Give up three years of my life? - Not give up, trade.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:38.80,0:16:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放弃三年的人生 - 不是放弃 是交换
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.44,0:16:44.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,Three years in return for the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:41.44,0:16:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,用三年交换一辈子的享福
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.08,0:16:47.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,One big paycheque. You're done.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:45.08,0:16:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,一张支票让你永远不愁吃穿
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.00,0:17:00.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,A lot can happen in three years.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:58.00,0:17:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,三年可能发生很多事
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.20,0:17:02.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,You blink, it'll be over. To you, it'll be two seconds.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:00.20,0:17:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一眨眼就过了 对你来说就像心跳一下就过去
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.40,0:17:07.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,A heartbeat, then snap, you're rich beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:02.40,0:17:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你会成为大富翁
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.92,0:17:10.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,One big paycheque. You're done.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:07.92,0:17:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这工作一做完你就能退休
Dialogue: 2,0:17:13.28,0:17:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,"手相术"
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.72,0:18:14.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr Jennings. John Wolfe. Welcome.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:11.72,0:18:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我是吴约翰 欢迎
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.32,0:18:18.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,You understand that you won't be allowed to leave the grounds.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:15.32,0:18:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你不准离开此地
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.20,0:18:20.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll be assigned a residence right here on campus.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:18.20,0:18:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须住在公司
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.68,0:18:23.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,All your mail will be screened, no outside phone calls.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:20.68,0:18:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,邮件要检查 不准打电话
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.20,0:18:25.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,Anything you do receive will have to be inspected.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:23.20,0:18:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你接到什么都要检查
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.84,0:18:27.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:25.84,0:18:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.32,0:18:31.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need all your personal belongings.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:29.32,0:18:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你身上的物件
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.12,0:18:32.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Watch, wallet, anything else you're carrying.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:31.12,0:18:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,手表 皮夹 所有的东西
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.08,0:18:36.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid nothing's allowed to be brought in.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:33.08,0:18:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你不准带任何东西进来
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.04,0:18:42.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,All these items will be returned to you when you pick up your paycheque.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:39.04,0:18:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,事成之后你会拿回来
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.68,0:18:44.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Those, too.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:42.68,0:18:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 这也要
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.20,0:18:53.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,Mike, hey, you made it.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:50.20,0:18:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,迈可 你来了
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.48,0:18:54.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Good to see you. - Good to see you, too.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:53.48,0:18:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 见到你真好 - 我也是
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.00,0:18:56.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Everything okay? - Yep.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:55.00,0:18:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一切都好吗？- 很好
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.48,0:19:00.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sit down.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:59.48,0:19:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,坐吧
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.72,0:19:02.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,I assume Mr Wolfe gave you all the fine print.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:00.72,0:19:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜吴先生都说清楚了
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.68,0:19:06.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah. He also took the last pair of sunglasses I've managed not to lose.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:02.68,0:19:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 他也把我的太阳眼镜拿走
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.12,0:19:09.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:08.12,0:19:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.32,0:19:18.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:16.32,0:19:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.88,0:19:20.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's for your memory wipe.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:18.88,0:19:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了消除你的记忆
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.64,0:19:23.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,We inject you with an isotope, migrates to your brain,
Dialogue: 2,0:19:20.64,0:19:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要先注射同位素 它会流到大脑
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.80,0:19:25.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,lodges, serves as a marker. Then when we're done,
Dialogue: 2,0:19:23.80,0:19:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,做下记号 事成后
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.64,0:19:28.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,another injection erases everything back to the marker.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:25.64,0:19:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,再注射一次消除记忆
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.20,0:19:30.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,No barbaric cooking of the brain.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:28.20,0:19:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不用把大脑煮熟
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.84,0:19:42.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:40.84,0:19:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.76,0:20:09.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,- What have I gotten myself into? - Let's go find out.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:05.76,0:20:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我到底要做什么事？- 我带你去看
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.28,0:20:20.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,Initiating Blue Script directoiy.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:17.28,0:20:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,启动系统
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.92,0:20:25.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:23.92,0:20:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,了不起
Dialogue: 1,0:20:25.72,0:20:29.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,This used to be our smallest unit. Now it's our most profitable.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:25.72,0:20:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这单位以前微不足道 现在却最会赚钱
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.72,0:20:32.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Mr Rethrick, may I speak with you for a moment?
Dialogue: 2,0:20:29.72,0:20:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,雷先生 请你来一下 我可以和你谈一会儿吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.32,0:20:35.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Have a look around. I'll be right back. - Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:32.32,0:20:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 慢慢参观 我马上回来 - 好的
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.40,0:20:41.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Cycle complete. Begin transmission of data.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:38.40,0:20:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,作业完成 传送资料
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.84,0:20:54.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,All right! I give up! I give up.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:52.84,0:20:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 我认输
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.20,0:21:15.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:14.20,0:21:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,别放弃
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.32,0:21:22.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,Dr Porter. I guess I'm lucky you didn't use thunder and lightning.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:18.32,0:21:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,卜博士 幸好你没用打雷闪电
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.56,0:21:23.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:22.56,0:21:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.36,0:21:34.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, well, I won't question your powers in the future.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:30.36,0:21:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我以后不会怀疑你的神力了
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.56,0:21:39.12,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I just couldn't help myself.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:36.56,0:21:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我忍不住
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.20,0:21:41.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought you said Marianne was on a plane today.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:39.20,0:21:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你说她今天就上飞机
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.88,0:21:45.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,She was planning to make the conference call from the plane, sir.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:41.88,0:21:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,她打算礼拜五赶回来开会
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.20,0:21:51.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, I should probably apologise for my behaviour the other day.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:47.20,0:21:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,听好 我要为我那天的行为道歉
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.64,0:21:54.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,I get like that sometimes, and I shouldn't. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:51.64,0:21:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我不该那么无礼
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.32,0:21:58.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,Careful. You are in danger of sounding like you want a second chance.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:54.32,0:21:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,说话小心点 你好像想争取第二次机会
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.56,0:22:09.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Everything okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:07.56,0:22:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？- 很好
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.92,0:22:29.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Say something else. - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:26.92,0:22:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 说点别的话 - 什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.84,0:22:32.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,Say something nice. Quick, otherwise I'll forget it.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:29.84,0:22:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,说点好听的话 快说 否则我会忘记
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.12,0:22:37.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,Was that little breeze for our boy here?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:35.12,0:22:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你让他吹吹风 是吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.64,0:22:41.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ah! Well, I owed him one. Now we're even.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:37.64,0:22:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他先惹毛我 这下扯平了
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.60,0:22:44.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, be nice 'cause Mike's moving into the neighbourhood.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:41.60,0:22:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,对他好一点 他是新邻居
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.96,0:22:50.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,- See you around. - Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:48.96,0:22:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回头见喽 - 好的
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.96,0:22:59.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,- You ready? - Yeah. Let's go.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:56.96,0:22:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗？- 好了 走吧
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.28,0:23:06.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, you can still back out.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:03.28,0:23:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在可以退出
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.84,0:23:07.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,No hard feelings.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:06.84,0:23:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会怪你
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.40,0:23:22.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, I want to stay.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:20.40,0:23:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我要留下来
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.68,0:23:27.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Michael Jennings, meet the other half of your team, Dr William Dekker.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:22.68,0:23:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,詹迈可 这是你的同事戴威廉博士
Dialogue: 1,0:23:32.08,0:23:34.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Nice to meet you. - It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:32.08,0:23:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 幸会 - 我的荣幸
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.84,0:23:39.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen. Let's have a look at the next three years of your lives.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:34.84,0:23:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你们未来三年的生活
Dialogue: 1,0:24:18.68,0:24:20.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 2,0:24:18.68,0:24:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 1,0:24:22.20,0:24:23.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Michael.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:22.20,0:24:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,迈可
Dialogue: 1,0:24:25.04,0:24:26.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're done.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:25.04,0:24:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你完成了
Dialogue: 1,0:24:29.60,0:24:33.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,- How long was it, Jimmy? - It's been three years, Mike.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:29.60,0:24:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 过了多久时间？- 整整三年
Dialogue: 1,0:24:35.28,0:24:37.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,- How'd I do? - You did good.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:35.28,0:24:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我表现得怎样？- 很好
Dialogue: 1,0:24:39.84,0:24:41.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Your money's been transferred to your account
Dialogue: 2,0:24:39.84,0:24:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你的酬劳已经汇到你的户头
Dialogue: 1,0:24:43.16,0:24:45.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,You've got an appointment there today at 1:00.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:43.16,0:24:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你一点钟跟律师有约
Dialogue: 1,0:24:45.48,0:24:49.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Just go home, do the papeiwork. When you feel up to it, give me a call.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:45.48,0:24:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,先回家休息一下 休息够了就打给我
Dialogue: 1,0:24:49.40,0:24:52.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,We've got a lot of catching up to do, Mike.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:49.40,0:24:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有很多事要聊
Dialogue: 2,0:24:52.24,0:24:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"爱康集团股票"
Dialogue: 2,0:25:04.12,0:25:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"总额：九千两百万美元"
Dialogue: 1,0:25:07.68,0:25:09.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,$92 million.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:07.68,0:25:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,九千两百万元
Dialogue: 1,0:25:36.12,0:25:38.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone at Reddy Grant&Associates appreciates your business, sir.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:36.12,0:25:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,本公司上下都很感激您
Dialogue: 1,0:25:38.88,0:25:42.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, not as much as I appreciate my business, I promise you.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:38.88,0:25:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我会更感激你们 别怀疑
Dialogue: 1,0:25:44.04,0:25:45.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:44.04,0:25:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 1,0:25:48.20,0:25:50.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,Just sign there.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:48.20,0:25:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,请您签名
Dialogue: 1,0:25:54.72,0:25:56.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,- All right. - Great.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:54.72,0:25:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可以了吗？- 很好
Dialogue: 1,0:25:57.04,0:25:59.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Your personal items. - Yes.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:57.04,0:25:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的私人物件 - 很好
Dialogue: 1,0:25:59.64,0:26:01.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,You only needed four stamps.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:59.64,0:26:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你只要贴四张邮票
Dialogue: 1,0:26:04.24,0:26:07.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, guess I could afford the extra 50 cents.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:04.24,0:26:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我猜我付得起吧
Dialogue: 1,0:26:16.76,0:26:19.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't think this is my stuff.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:16.76,0:26:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这些不是我的东西
Dialogue: 1,0:26:19.68,0:26:21.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,- It's not? - No.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:19.68,0:26:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是吗？- 不是
Dialogue: 1,0:26:22.64,0:26:26.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,- I don't know what happened. - It's all right. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:22.64,0:26:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道发生什么事 - 别担心
Dialogue: 1,0:26:26.68,0:26:29.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter. Let's talk about my shares.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:26.68,0:26:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 谈谈我的股票吧
Dialogue: 1,0:26:30.04,0:26:34.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,What I'd like to do is get some money now,
Dialogue: 2,0:26:30.04,0:26:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我想先拿一笔钱
Dialogue: 1,0:26:34.72,0:26:38.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,and, you know, put the rest away for long term, to live off.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:34.72,0:26:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,其余的存起来以后再用
Dialogue: 1,0:26:38.52,0:26:39.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,So how do we do that?
Dialogue: 2,0:26:38.52,0:26:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么处理？
Dialogue: 1,0:26:41.44,0:26:44.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr Jennings, you forfeited your shares.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:41.44,0:26:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,詹先生 你放弃你的股权
Dialogue: 1,0:26:46.56,0:26:48.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon? What?
Dialogue: 2,0:26:46.56,0:26:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:26:48.60,0:26:53.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, here. Dated four weeks ago.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:48.60,0:26:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,请看这儿 四星期前签字
Dialogue: 1,0:26:57.20,0:26:58.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,You surrendered the shares
Dialogue: 2,0:26:57.20,0:26:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你放弃股权
Dialogue: 1,0:26:58.40,0:27:00.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,and stated to deliver only the envelope of personals.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:58.40,0:27:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,只说要把这个信封寄来
Dialogue: 1,0:27:03.64,0:27:06.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Don't you remember doing that, sir? - No.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:03.64,0:27:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不记得吗？- 不记得
Dialogue: 1,0:27:08.52,0:27:11.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't remember that because I didn't do that.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:08.52,0:27:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我没有这么做
Dialogue: 1,0:27:12.56,0:27:17.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,Why would I do that? I wouldn't do that. It doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:12.56,0:27:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会这么做 太没道理了
Dialogue: 1,0:27:17.32,0:27:20.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,A mistake has been made, and it needs to be corrected.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:17.32,0:27:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个错误 一定要更正
Dialogue: 1,0:27:20.36,0:27:22.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I agree. It's a strange thing you did...
Dialogue: 2,0:27:20.36,0:27:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么做是很奇怪
Dialogue: 1,0:27:22.40,0:27:23.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's not strange.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:22.40,0:27:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是奇怪
Dialogue: 1,0:27:23.60,0:27:27.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Strange is a little out of the ordinary, but still plausible.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:23.60,0:27:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的事还是有可能发生
Dialogue: 1,0:27:27.44,0:27:30.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,Giving away $100 million in shares in a Fortune 500 company
Dialogue: 2,0:27:27.44,0:27:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃上市公司一亿元的股票
Dialogue: 1,0:27:30.28,0:27:33.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,for some knickknacks isn't strange, it's insane.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:30.28,0:27:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,换来这堆垃圾才不是奇怪 而是疯狂
Dialogue: 1,0:27:34.08,0:27:36.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,No one would do that. This doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:34.08,0:27:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人会这么做 根本说不通
Dialogue: 1,0:27:36.16,0:27:41.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,Unless you think this is a $40-million can of hair spray, which is pink.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:36.16,0:27:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,除非这瓶发胶值四千万 还是粉红色的咧
Dialogue: 1,0:27:41.60,0:27:44.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,What, this is a $100-million book of matches?
Dialogue: 2,0:27:41.60,0:27:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,难道这盒火柴值一亿吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:27:44.40,0:27:45.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,I've been a little out of it for a couple of years.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:44.40,0:27:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这几年时尚潮流又变了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:27:45.96,0:27:47.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know, is this back in style now?
Dialogue: 2,0:27:45.96,0:27:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 这是在现在的风格？
Dialogue: 1,0:27:47.24,0:27:50.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Are these $100-million sunglasses? Am I missing something here?
Dialogue: 2,0:27:47.24,0:27:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这是价值上亿的太阳眼镜吗？我是不是错过了什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:27:50.20,0:27:53.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll look into it, but it's gonna take me some time.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:50.20,0:27:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我会调查清楚 不过要花点时间
Dialogue: 1,0:27:53.32,0:27:55.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is crazy. I'm gonna make some phone calls.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:53.32,0:27:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这太扯了 我要去打电话
Dialogue: 1,0:27:55.52,0:27:56.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:55.52,0:27:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 1,0:28:05.48,0:28:06.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,MrRethrick's office.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:05.48,0:28:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,雷先生办公室
Dialogue: 1,0:28:06.92,0:28:08.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, it's Michael Jennings. Tell him it's important, please.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:06.92,0:28:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我是詹迈可 我有要事
Dialogue: 1,0:28:08.96,0:28:10.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh! I'm sony, but he stepped away.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:08.96,0:28:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 他不在
Dialogue: 1,0:28:11.00,0:28:12.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,He won't be back until later this afternoon.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:11.00,0:28:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,下午才会回来
Dialogue: 1,0:28:12.96,0:28:15.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,I can tiy him on his cell phone if you'd like.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:12.96,0:28:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以打他手机
Dialogue: 1,0:28:15.28,0:28:17.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,Just have him call me as soon as he gets in. Okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:28:15.28,0:28:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,请他尽快给我回电话 好吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:28:17.68,0:28:19.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Okay. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:17.68,0:28:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 2,0:29:28.28,0:29:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,"联邦调查局"
Dialogue: 1,0:29:33.52,0:29:37.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen, guys, a mistake has been made here. All right?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:33.52,0:29:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,听好 你们搞错了
Dialogue: 1,0:29:37.20,0:29:41.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,- I'm not a traitor. I'm an engineer. - A reverse engineer, right?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:37.20,0:29:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不是卖国贼 我是工程师 - 逆向工程师 对吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:29:41.48,0:29:43.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,We already know that you accepted payment
Dialogue: 2,0:29:41.48,0:29:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你受雇盗窃政府的
Dialogue: 1,0:29:43.68,0:29:46.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,of classified government technology.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:43.68,0:29:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,机密科技
Dialogue: 1,0:29:46.48,0:29:48.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,Mike, that's called treason.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:46.48,0:29:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这是叛国罪
Dialogue: 1,0:29:48.24,0:29:50.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,In this country, people get fried for that one.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:48.24,0:29:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,最高判死刑
Dialogue: 1,0:29:50.32,0:29:51.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:50.32,0:29:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 1,0:29:51.36,0:29:53.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,You know what? In this country, when the FBI harasses you,
Dialogue: 2,0:29:51.36,0:29:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,在美国被FBI骚扰
Dialogue: 1,0:29:53.56,0:29:55.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,you also get an attorney. Thanks very much.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:53.56,0:29:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,也可以请律师 非常感谢
Dialogue: 1,0:29:55.20,0:29:57.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Not today you don't. - What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:55.20,0:29:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你可不行 - 为什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:29:58.04,0:29:59.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is what happens when the Attorney General calls me
Dialogue: 2,0:29:58.04,0:29:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,因为司法部长亲口告诉我
Dialogue: 1,0:30:00.04,0:30:01.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,and says that Michael Jennings' cooperation
Dialogue: 2,0:30:00.04,0:30:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,詹迈可的配合
Dialogue: 1,0:30:02.24,0:30:04.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,is a matter of national security.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:02.24,0:30:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事彼关国家安全
Dialogue: 1,0:30:04.92,0:30:07.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, first of all, that stuff isn't mine, okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:04.92,0:30:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这些不是我的东西
Dialogue: 1,0:30:07.92,0:30:09.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,A mistake...
Dialogue: 2,0:30:07.92,0:30:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一个错误…
Dialogue: 1,0:30:16.04,0:30:18.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,What is...
Dialogue: 2,0:30:16.04,0:30:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 1,0:30:18.32,0:30:21.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Perfect fit. You were saying?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:18.32,0:30:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚好 你该怎么说？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:25.40,0:30:28.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, let me show you a few pieces of the puzzle that we're solving.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:25.40,0:30:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我就给你看一些线索吧
Dialogue: 1,0:30:28.92,0:30:32.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,William Dekker, government physicist, weapons division.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:28.92,0:30:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,戴威廉 物理学家 武器部门
Dialogue: 1,0:30:32.96,0:30:35.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,Three years ago, his project gets shelved.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:32.96,0:30:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,三年前他的计划被取消
Dialogue: 1,0:30:35.44,0:30:38.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,He didn't like that, so he sold his work. Classified work.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:35.44,0:30:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,于是他偷偷出卖机密科技
Dialogue: 1,0:30:39.08,0:30:40.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Showed it to several major corporations.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:39.08,0:30:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他向几家公司兜售
Dialogue: 1,0:30:40.72,0:30:42.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,We think Rethrick bought it.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:40.72,0:30:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,雷吉米买了下来
Dialogue: 1,0:30:42.12,0:30:47.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we can't link Rethrick to the sale, because Dekker died.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:42.12,0:30:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无法证明这点 因为戴威廉死于
Dialogue: 1,0:30:48.00,0:30:49.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Natural causes.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:48.00,0:30:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,自然因素
Dialogue: 1,0:30:49.44,0:30:53.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Natural being gravity after a 140-foot fall out of his apartment building.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:49.44,0:30:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是地心引力 他从公寓大楼摔下来
Dialogue: 1,0:30:55.08,0:30:56.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,So what does this have to do with me?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:55.08,0:30:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我有什么关系？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:56.76,0:30:59.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,These are patent applications filed this month.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:56.76,0:30:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这些是这个月的专利申请表
Dialogue: 1,0:30:59.60,0:31:02.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,They show designs based on Dekker's work.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:59.60,0:31:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,上面是戴威廉的发明
Dialogue: 1,0:31:02.12,0:31:05.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,Look whose signature is on every one of those documents.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:02.12,0:31:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,每件表格上都有你的签字
Dialogue: 1,0:31:05.84,0:31:07.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it? It's your name on those patents!
Dialogue: 2,0:31:05.84,0:31:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,上面有你的签字
Dialogue: 1,0:31:08.04,0:31:09.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Rethrick can claim he knows nothing about Dekker
Dialogue: 2,0:31:08.04,0:31:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,雷吉米可以说他
Dialogue: 1,0:31:09.72,0:31:10.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,or where the design came from.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:09.72,0:31:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,对此一无所知
Dialogue: 1,0:31:10.92,0:31:13.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,So what you need to do is tell us everything that you did for Rethrick.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:10.92,0:31:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你要说出你为他做了什么
Dialogue: 1,0:31:13.64,0:31:14.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:13.64,0:31:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,马上
Dialogue: 1,0:31:17.36,0:31:19.92,Eng,,0,0,0,,- I can't. - You'd rather spend the rest of your life
Dialogue: 2,0:31:17.36,0:31:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我办不到 - 你要为了这朋友
Dialogue: 1,0:31:20.00,0:31:21.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,in prison protecting your so-called friend?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:20.00,0:31:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,坐一辈子牢？
Dialogue: 1,0:31:22.04,0:31:23.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Just help us, and we can work with you.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:22.04,0:31:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,乖乖合作我们就能帮你
Dialogue: 1,0:31:23.52,0:31:25.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't. I can't!
Dialogue: 2,0:31:23.52,0:31:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 不行
Dialogue: 1,0:31:25.96,0:31:28.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,He wiped my memory! I don't remember!
Dialogue: 2,0:31:25.96,0:31:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他消除我的记忆 我不记得了
Dialogue: 1,0:31:28.44,0:31:29.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ill tell you whatever I know. I was set up.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:28.44,0:31:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我被陷害了 我也想合作
Dialogue: 1,0:31:29.96,0:31:32.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,But I swear to God, you have to believe me,
Dialogue: 2,0:31:29.96,0:31:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但是请相信我
Dialogue: 1,0:31:32.16,0:31:34.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't remember what I did for the past three years!
Dialogue: 2,0:31:32.16,0:31:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我不记得这三年做了什么
Dialogue: 1,0:31:44.00,0:31:45.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,What? Wait a second!
Dialogue: 2,0:31:44.00,0:31:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛？慢着
Dialogue: 1,0:31:53.52,0:31:55.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 2,0:31:53.52,0:31:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 1,0:31:56.00,0:31:57.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,We figured Rethrick might have tried a wipe,
Dialogue: 2,0:31:56.00,0:31:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你的记忆被消除
Dialogue: 1,0:31:57.48,0:31:59.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,so we'll try an extraction.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:57.48,0:31:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我要找回来
Dialogue: 1,0:31:59.20,0:32:01.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna see anything. I'm telling you, you're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:59.20,0:32:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,什么也找不到 别浪费时间
Dialogue: 2,0:32:13.56,0:32:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,"危险"
Dialogue: 2,0:32:16.28,0:32:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,"大脑温度"
Dialogue: 1,0:32:19.92,0:32:21.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,We're getting something here.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:19.92,0:32:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,找到什么了
Dialogue: 1,0:32:26.04,0:32:27.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 2,0:32:26.04,0:32:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点
Dialogue: 1,0:32:43.32,0:32:45.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:43.32,0:32:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 1,0:32:45.12,0:32:46.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,We got nothing.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:45.12,0:32:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,什么也没有
Dialogue: 1,0:32:47.04,0:32:50.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second. I need a smoke.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:47.04,0:32:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 我得抽根烟
Dialogue: 1,0:32:50.48,0:32:52.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Boss.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:50.48,0:32:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,老大
Dialogue: 1,0:32:52.92,0:32:54.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,He won't mind.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:52.92,0:32:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会介意的
Dialogue: 1,0:33:17.24,0:33:18.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Smoke! - Shit!
Dialogue: 2,0:33:17.24,0:33:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有烟 - 该死
Dialogue: 1,0:33:18.56,0:33:21.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,- God damn it! - I can't see anything!
Dialogue: 2,0:33:18.56,0:33:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 上帝 - 我什么也看不见了
Dialogue: 1,0:33:23.72,0:33:25.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Secure the door!
Dialogue: 2,0:33:23.72,0:33:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,把门关上
Dialogue: 1,0:33:28.76,0:33:30.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is he?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:28.76,0:33:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他人呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:33:31.00,0:33:33.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,- He's loose! - Don't worry, he can't go anywhere!
Dialogue: 2,0:33:31.00,0:33:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他挣脱了 - 放心 他出不去
Dialogue: 1,0:33:36.08,0:33:38.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Cover the door!
Dialogue: 2,0:33:36.08,0:33:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,守住门口
Dialogue: 1,0:33:38.52,0:33:40.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll get the lights!
Dialogue: 2,0:33:38.52,0:33:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,快开灯
Dialogue: 1,0:33:42.92,0:33:44.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't see!
Dialogue: 2,0:33:42.92,0:33:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不到
Dialogue: 1,0:33:46.20,0:33:48.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Get low to the ground! Try to stay low to the ground!
Dialogue: 2,0:33:46.20,0:33:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,趴低 趴低一点
Dialogue: 1,0:33:55.28,0:33:57.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Mitchell!
Dialogue: 2,0:33:55.28,0:33:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,米契
Dialogue: 1,0:33:58.04,0:33:59.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,See anything?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:58.04,0:33:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,看到什么吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:34:04.44,0:34:06.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Is that him? - Klein, where'd you go?
Dialogue: 2,0:34:04.44,0:34:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是他么？- 克莱恩 他人呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:34:08.60,0:34:09.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,Al, shut the door!
Dialogue: 2,0:34:08.60,0:34:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,把门关上
Dialogue: 1,0:34:11.28,0:34:13.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 2,0:34:11.28,0:34:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 1,0:34:24.80,0:34:26.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,Good night, Mikey.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:24.80,0:34:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,永别了 迈可
Dialogue: 1,0:35:19.36,0:35:21.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Watch it, coming through! - Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 2,0:35:19.36,0:35:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看 过来 - 去 去 去
Dialogue: 1,0:35:21.44,0:35:23.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Coming through! - Out of the way!
Dialogue: 2,0:35:21.44,0:35:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 过来 - 闪开
Dialogue: 1,0:35:23.40,0:35:25.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,- See him? - I see him!
Dialogue: 2,0:35:23.40,0:35:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看到他了？- 我看到了
Dialogue: 1,0:35:29.36,0:35:31.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Out of the way, lady! - There!
Dialogue: 2,0:35:29.36,0:35:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闪开 女士 - 在那儿
Dialogue: 1,0:35:31.72,0:35:33.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Move! Move! Move! - Move!
Dialogue: 2,0:35:31.72,0:35:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行动 行动 行动 - 行动
Dialogue: 2,0:35:36.24,0:35:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,"公车票"
Dialogue: 1,0:35:41.88,0:35:43.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Coming through! - Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 2,0:35:41.88,0:35:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 过来 - 快 快走
Dialogue: 1,0:35:44.00,0:35:45.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 2,0:35:44.00,0:35:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:35:47.88,0:35:49.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Coming through!
Dialogue: 2,0:35:47.88,0:35:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 1,0:35:49.92,0:35:52.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Out of the way! Open those gates! - Watch it, man. Watch it!
Dialogue: 2,0:35:49.92,0:35:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让开 快开闸门 - 注意 伙计 注意
Dialogue: 1,0:35:57.68,0:35:59.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 2,0:35:57.68,0:35:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快
Dialogue: 1,0:36:00.56,0:36:02.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,Where did he go? Where did he go?
Dialogue: 2,0:36:00.56,0:36:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他跑哪儿去了？
Dialogue: 1,0:36:03.92,0:36:05.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll get men at every stop.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:03.92,0:36:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,拦下所有公车
Dialogue: 1,0:36:05.52,0:36:09.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,He'll be long gone by then! How the hell did he do that?
Dialogue: 2,0:36:05.52,0:36:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他早就跑了 他怎么能逃出去？
Dialogue: 1,0:36:52.00,0:36:53.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Sorry. - You all right?
Dialogue: 2,0:36:52.00,0:36:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:36:53.12,0:36:55.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, yeah, yeah. I'm fine. - Be careful.
Dialogue: 2,0:36:53.12,0:36:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没事 - 小心点
Dialogue: 1,0:37:00.16,0:37:01.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,Watch it!
Dialogue: 2,0:37:00.16,0:37:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,注意
Dialogue: 1,0:37:25.24,0:37:27.54,Eng,,0,0,0,,Relax. Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:25.24,0:37:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,别紧张 没事了
Dialogue: 1,0:37:27.68,0:37:29.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,I know you talked to federal agents. It's okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:27.68,0:37:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你去找FBI 没关系
Dialogue: 1,0:37:29.48,0:37:31.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's been worked out now.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:29.48,0:37:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都搞定了
Dialogue: 1,0:37:31.48,0:37:34.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,I just need to find out who sent these items.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:31.48,0:37:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想知道这是谁寄的
Dialogue: 1,0:37:34.84,0:37:36.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Will you help me out?
Dialogue: 2,0:37:34.84,0:37:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你能帮忙吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:37:37.88,0:37:39.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,They were sent three years ago.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:37.88,0:37:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你在三年前寄的
Dialogue: 1,0:37:39.40,0:37:40.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, no. Remember, there was a mix-up.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:39.40,0:37:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 搞错了
Dialogue: 1,0:37:40.68,0:37:42.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,See, these weren't the ones that were sent three years ago.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:40.68,0:37:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是三年前寄的
Dialogue: 1,0:37:42.52,0:37:44.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Somebody else sent these. I need to find out who that is.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:42.52,0:37:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这是别人寄的 我要查出是谁
Dialogue: 1,0:37:44.16,0:37:45.30,Eng,,0,0,0,,I need talk to them.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:44.16,0:37:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要跟他们谈谈
Dialogue: 1,0:37:45.40,0:37:47.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, you're right, replacements were sent a few weeks ago.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:45.40,0:37:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 这是几个星期前寄的
Dialogue: 1,0:37:47.24,0:37:49.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Who sent it? - Well, you did.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:47.24,0:37:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁寄的？- 你呀
Dialogue: 1,0:37:52.20,0:37:54.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's you right here. See? Twenty items.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:52.20,0:37:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你的签字 二十样物件
Dialogue: 1,0:38:00.84,0:38:03.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need all your personal belongings.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:00.84,0:38:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你身上的物件
Dialogue: 1,0:38:14.40,0:38:16.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,Michael Jennings died at three minutes after 3:00.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:14.40,0:38:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,詹迈可在三点零三分死亡
Dialogue: 1,0:38:17.20,0:38:21.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,The government, left with no case, closed its investigation of AlIcom.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:17.20,0:38:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,政府没有证据指控爱康集团
Dialogue: 1,0:38:22.04,0:38:24.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,So, you see,
Dialogue: 2,0:38:22.04,0:38:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢
Dialogue: 1,0:38:24.72,0:38:28.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,it's impossible that he escaped unless you changed something.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:24.72,0:38:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你做错事他才会逃走
Dialogue: 1,0:38:28.40,0:38:30.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:28.40,0:38:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有
Dialogue: 1,0:38:31.80,0:38:34.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,- What were you doing exactly? - I was eating pie.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:31.80,0:38:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你当时在做什么？- 我在吃苹果派
Dialogue: 1,0:38:38.00,0:38:40.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,He left the attorney's office exactly when it predicted.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:38.00,0:38:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他准时从律师事务所出来
Dialogue: 1,0:38:41.08,0:38:43.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,The Feds took him exactly when it predicted...
Dialogue: 2,0:38:41.08,0:38:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,联邦探员也在预估时间逮捕他
Dialogue: 1,0:38:43.48,0:38:46.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,But he didn't die like it predicted!
Dialogue: 2,0:38:43.48,0:38:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他却没有死
Dialogue: 1,0:38:49.56,0:38:51.86,Eng,,0,0,0,,Michael Jennings is not a super agent.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:49.56,0:38:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是超人
Dialogue: 1,0:38:51.96,0:38:53.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,He's an engineer.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:51.96,0:38:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,只是个工程师
Dialogue: 1,0:38:53.60,0:38:56.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yet somehow he managed to escape from a double-locked room.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:53.60,0:38:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他却从密室逃走
Dialogue: 1,0:38:56.96,0:39:00.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,How? Was it fate?
Dialogue: 2,0:38:56.96,0:39:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会？是命运吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:39:00.28,0:39:01.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, fate was on our side.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:00.28,0:39:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们掌握了命运
Dialogue: 1,0:39:01.60,0:39:04.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,That means someone who knew changed something. And it wasn't me.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:01.60,0:39:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,有人改变了什么 不是我
Dialogue: 1,0:39:04.92,0:39:07.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,And if it wasn't you, then who the...
Dialogue: 2,0:39:04.92,0:39:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是你 那会是谁？
Dialogue: 1,0:39:16.92,0:39:20.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,Has anyone checked the machine since Michael walked out of here?
Dialogue: 2,0:39:16.92,0:39:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,迈可走后有人动过机器吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:39:48.16,0:39:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,"错误"
Dialogue: 1,0:39:58.84,0:40:00.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,Find him.
Dialogue: 2,0:39:58.84,0:40:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,找到他
Dialogue: 1,0:40:30.92,0:40:35.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,if you only look where you can't go, you will miss the riches below.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:30.92,0:40:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你只看逃不了的地方 就会错失底下的财富
Dialogue: 1,0:40:36.52,0:40:39.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm already missing my riches.
Dialogue: 2,0:40:36.52,0:40:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就失去我的财富了
Dialogue: 1,0:40:39.92,0:40:44.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,17-44-4-26-37-4O-22.\N17 44 4 26 37 40 22
Dialogue: 1,0:40:45.56,0:40:47.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,A combination? A code?
Dialogue: 2,0:40:45.56,0:40:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这是代码吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:40:49.32,0:40:51.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,A password?
Dialogue: 2,0:40:49.32,0:40:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,或是密码？
Dialogue: 1,0:41:30.68,0:41:33.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,New Liberty Savings.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:30.68,0:41:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,新自由储蓄银行
Dialogue: 1,0:41:33.56,0:41:36.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,New Liberty Savings Bank, please.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:33.56,0:41:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,请查新自由储蓄银行
Dialogue: 1,0:41:37.96,0:41:39.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 2,0:41:37.96,0:41:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思？
Dialogue: 1,0:41:41.64,0:41:44.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're saying the bank doesn't exist?
Dialogue: 2,0:41:41.64,0:41:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这家银行不存在？
Dialogue: 2,0:41:55.04,0:41:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,"猜字游戏"
Dialogue: 1,0:41:58.36,0:42:00.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's comforting.
Dialogue: 2,0:41:58.36,0:42:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,真令人安心
Dialogue: 1,0:42:18.96,0:42:21.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,Who sent these items?
Dialogue: 2,0:42:18.96,0:42:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这是谁寄的？
Dialogue: 1,0:42:21.32,0:42:23.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,You did.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:21.32,0:42:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你呀
Dialogue: 1,0:42:23.28,0:42:26.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's you right here. See? Twenty items.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:23.28,0:42:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的签字 二十样物件
Dialogue: 1,0:42:31.24,0:42:32.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,These are patent applications.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:31.24,0:42:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这些是专利申请表
Dialogue: 1,0:42:32.80,0:42:36.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Look whose signature is on eveiy one of those documents.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:32.80,0:42:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,每件表格上都有你的签字
Dialogue: 1,0:42:36.92,0:42:38.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,A mistake has been made here.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:36.92,0:42:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你们搞错了
Dialogue: 1,0:42:38.52,0:42:39.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not a traitor.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:38.52,0:42:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是卖国贼
Dialogue: 1,0:42:43.52,0:42:44.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Dekker died.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:43.52,0:42:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,戴威廉挂了
Dialogue: 1,0:42:44.92,0:42:46.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Rethrick can claim he knows nothing about Dekker
Dialogue: 2,0:42:44.92,0:42:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,雷吉米可以说他对此
Dialogue: 1,0:42:46.72,0:42:47.86,Eng,,0,0,0,,or where the design came from.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:46.72,0:42:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,一无所知
Dialogue: 1,0:42:48.00,0:42:49.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,You have to believe me.
Dialogue: 2,0:42:48.00,0:42:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你要相信我
Dialogue: 1,0:42:49.16,0:42:51.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't remember what I did for the past three years!
Dialogue: 2,0:42:49.16,0:42:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不记得这三年做了什么
Dialogue: 1,0:43:01.48,0:43:02.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're done.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:01.48,0:43:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你完成了
Dialogue: 1,0:43:09.20,0:43:10.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:09.20,0:43:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哈喽
Dialogue: 1,0:43:10.28,0:43:12.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Jesus, Shorty.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:10.28,0:43:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,小歪
Dialogue: 1,0:43:13.08,0:43:15.46,Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't know how good it is to hear a familiar voice.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:13.08,0:43:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,听到你的声音真好
Dialogue: 1,0:43:15.56,0:43:16.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Michael?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:15.56,0:43:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,迈可？
Dialogue: 1,0:43:17.00,0:43:18.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen, man.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:17.00,0:43:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 1,0:43:18.88,0:43:21.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm in a jam, and I need you.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:18.88,0:43:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我的麻烦大了 我需要你
Dialogue: 1,0:43:21.64,0:43:22.78,Eng,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:21.64,0:43:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 1,0:43:22.88,0:43:25.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Meet me at Union Station at 9:00.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:22.88,0:43:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,九点在联合车站碰面
Dialogue: 1,0:43:26.04,0:43:28.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,- I'll be there. - Okay, buddy.
Dialogue: 2,0:43:26.04,0:43:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我一定会到 - 好 老弟
Dialogue: 1,0:44:38.08,0:44:41.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,Say one word about this hat and I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:38.08,0:44:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你敢笑我的帽子我就走人
Dialogue: 1,0:44:50.72,0:44:52.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 2,0:44:50.72,0:44:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 伙计
Dialogue: 1,0:44:52.80,0:44:54.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:52.80,0:44:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天
Dialogue: 1,0:45:03.44,0:45:06.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,I told you not to take that job, Mike.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:03.44,0:45:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你别接这案子
Dialogue: 1,0:45:11.32,0:45:13.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Come on, let's get a table. - Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:11.32,0:45:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来吧 找位子坐 - 好的
Dialogue: 1,0:45:15.28,0:45:16.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Injections? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:15.28,0:45:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 注射？- 是的
Dialogue: 1,0:45:17.00,0:45:20.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you would have to do it that way, I guess.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:17.00,0:45:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜只有这样做才行
Dialogue: 1,0:45:20.48,0:45:22.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,But, of course, that's a chemical process.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:20.48,0:45:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不过那是化学方法
Dialogue: 1,0:45:22.72,0:45:23.70,Eng,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 2,0:45:22.72,0:45:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:45:23.80,0:45:26.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, you'd have some latent memories.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:23.80,0:45:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你会有潜伏的记忆
Dialogue: 1,0:45:28.44,0:45:29.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's what I'm seeing.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:28.44,0:45:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我才有幻觉
Dialogue: 1,0:45:29.96,0:45:32.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Most likely. I mean, memories that made it through the wash,
Dialogue: 2,0:45:29.96,0:45:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是吧 残留下来的记忆
Dialogue: 1,0:45:33.00,0:45:35.30,Eng,,0,0,0,,and then got stirred up when the Feds went into your head.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:33.00,0:45:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,被联邦探员唤醒了
Dialogue: 1,0:45:35.40,0:45:37.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Why would I have these things?
Dialogue: 2,0:45:35.40,0:45:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么会有这些？
Dialogue: 1,0:45:38.32,0:45:39.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Explain this.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:38.32,0:45:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你倒是说说看
Dialogue: 1,0:45:39.72,0:45:43.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,I sent myself this junk instead of the money.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:39.72,0:45:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我把这堆垃圾寄给自己
Dialogue: 1,0:45:43.32,0:45:45.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, brother.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:43.32,0:45:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 兄弟
Dialogue: 1,0:45:45.48,0:45:47.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:45.48,0:45:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 1,0:45:47.48,0:45:49.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,But that's not the question you should be asking yourself.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:47.48,0:45:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你该问的问题
Dialogue: 1,0:45:49.72,0:45:50.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,- No? - No.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:49.72,0:45:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是吗？- 不是
Dialogue: 1,0:45:50.84,0:45:52.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,The question that you should be asking yourself is,
Dialogue: 2,0:45:50.84,0:45:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你该问的问题是
Dialogue: 1,0:45:53.28,0:45:56.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,why did you give up all that money?
Dialogue: 2,0:45:53.28,0:45:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么放弃那笔钱？
Dialogue: 1,0:45:56.72,0:45:59.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the most bizarre part of this whole thing.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:56.72,0:45:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这是最奇怪的一点
Dialogue: 1,0:45:59.32,0:46:02.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,$90 million. Nobody changes that much in three years.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:59.32,0:46:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,九千万元 没有人会放弃这笔巨款
Dialogue: 1,0:46:04.48,0:46:06.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, my buddy.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:04.48,0:46:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 兄弟
Dialogue: 1,0:46:06.36,0:46:08.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,I wanna figure out what you built.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:06.36,0:46:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你要知道你做了什么
Dialogue: 1,0:46:08.60,0:46:10.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, let's work backwards.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:08.60,0:46:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就要努力回想
Dialogue: 1,0:46:11.00,0:46:14.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,They told me that I was working on a design by someone named Dekker.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:11.00,0:46:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说我跟姓戴的一起工作
Dialogue: 1,0:46:14.52,0:46:16.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Dekker? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:14.52,0:46:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 姓戴的？- 对
Dialogue: 1,0:46:17.00,0:46:19.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,- William Dekker? - I think so.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:17.00,0:46:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 戴威廉？- 应该是
Dialogue: 1,0:46:21.04,0:46:24.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,What I heard was, he was working on something level five for the Feds,
Dialogue: 2,0:46:21.04,0:46:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,听说他为联邦调查局做研究
Dialogue: 1,0:46:24.84,0:46:26.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,when they came in one day and they just shut him down.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:24.84,0:46:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,有一天突然被关闭
Dialogue: 1,0:46:26.76,0:46:29.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,- What was it? - The consensus was a laser.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:26.76,0:46:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么研究？- 听说是一种雷射
Dialogue: 1,0:46:30.04,0:46:32.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Why was that? - Well, because Dekker's drawings
Dialogue: 2,0:46:30.04,0:46:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 因为他的设计图
Dialogue: 1,0:46:32.60,0:46:34.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,called for a mirror and a lens.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:32.60,0:46:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有光学镜片
Dialogue: 1,0:46:34.24,0:46:35.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, the only thing that uses those designs
Dialogue: 2,0:46:34.24,0:46:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,只有雷射
Dialogue: 1,0:46:35.72,0:46:37.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,is a laser or some kind of satellite camera...
Dialogue: 2,0:46:35.72,0:46:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,或卫星摄影才用得到
Dialogue: 1,0:46:37.84,0:46:43.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Here comes the first number, 17. Followed by 44.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:37.84,0:46:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,开出来的第一个号码17 下一个号码是44
Dialogue: 1,0:46:44.08,0:46:47.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,- The lens required perfect optics. - Four.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:44.08,0:46:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这些镜片必须完美无缺 - 4
Dialogue: 1,0:46:47.56,0:46:50.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,- The mirror... - Twenty-six.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:47.56,0:46:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 镜子 - 26
Dialogue: 1,0:46:50.24,0:46:53.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,- So the capital outlay is huge. - Thirty-seven.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:50.24,0:46:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以成本相当庞大 - 36
Dialogue: 1,0:46:53.28,0:46:55.58,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Word was the thing was gonna cost... - Forty.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:53.28,0:46:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 将要花费 - 40
Dialogue: 2,0:46:55.68,0:47:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 5000亿美元 - 特别号是22
Dialogue: 1,0:46:55.68,0:47:01.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,-$500 billion. - And the bonus number is 22.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:01.12,0:47:05.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is gonna spend $500 billion just to see something?
Dialogue: 2,0:47:01.12,0:47:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,谁会花五千亿元只为了看什么东西？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:09.52,0:47:11.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 2,0:47:09.52,0:47:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:12.20,0:47:13.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,There's no way I got out of that extraction room
Dialogue: 2,0:47:12.20,0:47:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有香烟跟太阳眼镜
Dialogue: 1,0:47:14.32,0:47:17.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,without the cigarettes and the glasses.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:14.32,0:47:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,就逃出不侦讯室
Dialogue: 1,0:47:18.72,0:47:21.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,I would've never gotten on that bus without the bus ticket.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:18.72,0:47:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没有公车票也上不了公车
Dialogue: 1,0:47:21.24,0:47:23.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,If I didn't have the diamond ring,
Dialogue: 2,0:47:21.24,0:47:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没有那枚钻戒
Dialogue: 1,0:47:23.24,0:47:24.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have followed that kid to Reddy Grant.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:23.24,0:47:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,更不会回去律师事务所
Dialogue: 1,0:47:25.00,0:47:27.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Right. -I gave up that money
Dialogue: 2,0:47:25.00,0:47:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 我放弃那笔钱
Dialogue: 1,0:47:29.40,0:47:32.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,just to make sure that I would pay attention to these items.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:29.40,0:47:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了让自己注意这些小东西
Dialogue: 1,0:47:33.04,0:47:34.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 2,0:47:33.04,0:47:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:34.68,0:47:38.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,Because I know what you'd spend $500 billion to see.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:34.68,0:47:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道花五千亿元能看到什么
Dialogue: 1,0:47:42.80,0:47:44.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,The future.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:42.80,0:47:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,未来
Dialogue: 1,0:47:46.64,0:47:48.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,If you selected five of the numbers
Dialogue: 2,0:47:46.64,0:47:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,如果中了五个号码
Dialogue: 1,0:47:48.20,0:47:50.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,and the bonus number, you're a second-prize winner.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:48.20,0:47:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,外加特别号 就是二奖得主
Dialogue: 1,0:47:50.88,0:47:51.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,He used a virus.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:50.88,0:47:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他用了电脑病毒
Dialogue: 1,0:47:52.40,0:47:55.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,The machine went down at 3:03 this afternoon.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:52.40,0:47:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,下午三点零三分当机
Dialogue: 1,0:47:56.60,0:47:58.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,3:03.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:56.60,0:47:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,三点零三分？
Dialogue: 1,0:48:01.96,0:48:04.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Can you programme around the virus?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:01.96,0:48:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你能消灭病毒吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:48:04.16,0:48:06.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,No. It's not that kind of virus.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:04.16,0:48:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 这种病毒很特别
Dialogue: 1,0:48:06.92,0:48:08.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ill show you.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:06.92,0:48:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我带你去看
Dialogue: 1,0:48:17.68,0:48:20.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's not in the software.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:17.68,0:48:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,病毒不在软件
Dialogue: 1,0:48:23.00,0:48:25.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's in the hardware. He put a circuit somewhere in here.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:23.00,0:48:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是在硬件 他加装了电路板
Dialogue: 1,0:48:25.96,0:48:28.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's like a poison pill.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:25.96,0:48:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这就像毒药
Dialogue: 1,0:48:29.00,0:48:30.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,But you can find it, right?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:29.00,0:48:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你找得到 对吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:48:32.08,0:48:33.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:32.08,0:48:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我找得到
Dialogue: 1,0:48:36.48,0:48:38.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Then do it.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:36.48,0:48:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那就快找吧
Dialogue: 1,0:48:39.04,0:48:41.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Slight change of plans.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:39.04,0:48:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,计划改变
Dialogue: 1,0:48:41.40,0:48:44.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,According to Mr Stevens, we don't need Michael Jennings any more.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:41.40,0:48:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,史蒂芬说不需要詹迈可了
Dialogue: 1,0:48:44.52,0:48:49.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, if we know anything, we know that time travel's not possible.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:44.52,0:48:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道的是 时间旅行是不可能的
Dialogue: 1,0:48:49.24,0:48:51.54,Eng,,0,0,0,,Einstein proved that, right?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:49.24,0:48:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,爱因斯坦证明了这一点
Dialogue: 1,0:48:51.64,0:48:53.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Time travel, yes.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:51.64,0:48:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 但是
Dialogue: 1,0:48:53.36,0:48:56.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,But Einstein was very clear that he believed time viewing
Dialogue: 2,0:48:53.36,0:48:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,爱因斯坦也说过 他相信
Dialogue: 1,0:48:56.48,0:49:00.02,Eng,,0,0,0,,- theoretically could be accomplished... - Mike, Mike, Mike, Mike. Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:56.48,0:49:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 预见未来的可能性 - 迈可 迈可 迈可 迈可 快
Dialogue: 1,0:49:00.12,0:49:02.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should just find Dekker...
Dialogue: 2,0:49:00.12,0:49:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 也许找到戴威廉…
Dialogue: 1,0:49:02.36,0:49:04.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,- I can't talk to Dekker. - Why not?
Dialogue: 2,0:49:02.36,0:49:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 找不到他 - 为什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:49:04.72,0:49:06.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,- He had an accident. - An accident?
Dialogue: 2,0:49:04.72,0:49:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他出了意外 - 意外？
Dialogue: 1,0:49:07.04,0:49:09.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he...
Dialogue: 2,0:49:07.04,0:49:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 他
Dialogue: 1,0:49:09.16,0:49:11.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,He fell out of his bedroom window.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:09.16,0:49:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他从公寓大楼掉下去
Dialogue: 1,0:49:11.36,0:49:12.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,He fell out of...
Dialogue: 2,0:49:11.36,0:49:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,掉下去
Dialogue: 1,0:49:15.08,0:49:17.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,He fell out of his bedroom window!
Dialogue: 2,0:49:15.08,0:49:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他从公寓大楼掉下去
Dialogue: 1,0:49:19.68,0:49:22.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,I see. Sure.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:19.68,0:49:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 1,0:49:22.12,0:49:24.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,That could happen.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:22.12,0:49:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这是有可能的
Dialogue: 1,0:49:26.04,0:49:27.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Jesus. Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 2,0:49:26.04,0:49:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝 等等
Dialogue: 1,0:49:27.52,0:49:31.06,Eng,,0,0,0,,- We gotta get ourselves out of here! - Shorty, listen to me.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:27.52,0:49:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们得快走 - 听我说
Dialogue: 1,0:49:31.20,0:49:35.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,I think what happened was I used this thing, I saw my future.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:31.20,0:49:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我的猜想是我用这机器看到我的未来
Dialogue: 1,0:49:37.04,0:49:39.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,And I saw what I needed to change it.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:37.04,0:49:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,知道我必须改变未来
Dialogue: 1,0:49:39.80,0:49:43.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,But all I could get out of AlIcom were these, you know, innocuous items.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:39.80,0:49:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我只能拿到这些小东西
Dialogue: 1,0:49:44.00,0:49:46.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Each item has to be used at a specific time in a specific place
Dialogue: 2,0:49:44.00,0:49:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,每样东西都能派上用场
Dialogue: 1,0:49:46.68,0:49:49.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,to accomplish whatever it was I needed to get done.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:46.68,0:49:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,完成我必须做的事
Dialogue: 1,0:49:49.12,0:49:51.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean, without the stuff in here, I'd already be dead.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:49.12,0:49:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没有这些东西我早就挂了
Dialogue: 1,0:49:52.80,0:49:57.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, it's too bad that you don't know what the rest of them are for.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:52.80,0:49:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜你不知道其它的有何用途
Dialogue: 1,0:50:00.96,0:50:02.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:00.96,0:50:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:22.60,0:50:24.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 2,0:50:22.60,0:50:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你死了
Dialogue: 1,0:50:37.60,0:50:39.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Great seeing you again, Mike!
Dialogue: 2,0:50:37.60,0:50:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,见到你有够衰了
Dialogue: 1,0:50:39.96,0:50:41.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,Jesus!
Dialogue: 2,0:50:39.96,0:50:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝
Dialogue: 1,0:50:57.88,0:51:00.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Those guys do not look like Feds.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:57.88,0:51:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不像是联邦探员
Dialogue: 1,0:51:02.32,0:51:05.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Here. Listen to me. Take this.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:02.32,0:51:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去 这把钥匙能打开那道门
Dialogue: 1,0:51:05.20,0:51:07.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,This key will get you through that door. Close it behind you.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:05.20,0:51:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,进去了就关门 快去
Dialogue: 1,0:51:07.48,0:51:10.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,- You understand? Go! Go! Go on! - Okay!
Dialogue: 2,0:51:07.48,0:51:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明白了吗？快 快 快去 - 好的
Dialogue: 1,0:51:18.48,0:51:19.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 2,0:51:18.48,0:51:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,快去
Dialogue: 1,0:51:44.64,0:51:47.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, God, I hope that was a good thing to do.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:44.64,0:51:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,希望我这么做是对的
Dialogue: 1,0:54:22.12,0:54:23.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:22.12,0:54:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你走吧
Dialogue: 1,0:54:24.84,0:54:26.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Where's your gun?
Dialogue: 2,0:54:24.84,0:54:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你的枪呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:54:27.08,0:54:28.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,He's got it.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:27.08,0:54:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,被他抢走
Dialogue: 1,0:54:40.04,0:54:43.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,So, how are you, Mike?
Dialogue: 2,0:54:40.04,0:54:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你好吗 迈可？
Dialogue: 1,0:54:46.04,0:54:48.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 2,0:54:46.04,0:54:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是你？
Dialogue: 1,0:54:48.60,0:54:50.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 2,0:54:48.60,0:54:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:54:50.88,0:54:53.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't remember?
Dialogue: 2,0:54:50.88,0:54:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你不记得吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:54:53.44,0:54:55.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,You brought this on yourself, Mike.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:53.44,0:54:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是你自己造成的
Dialogue: 1,0:55:02.08,0:55:06.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,So how does it feel knowing you're going to die?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:02.08,0:55:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,知道你要死的感觉如何？
Dialogue: 1,0:57:12.08,0:57:14.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,So you're saying he designed his own escape?
Dialogue: 2,0:57:12.08,0:57:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说他安排自己的逃亡？
Dialogue: 1,0:57:14.20,0:57:17.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr Attorney General, sir, we have no explanation.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:14.20,0:57:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,部长先生 没别的解释
Dialogue: 1,0:57:17.48,0:57:18.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Because after looking at all the evidence,
Dialogue: 2,0:57:17.48,0:57:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们看过所有证据
Dialogue: 1,0:57:18.96,0:57:22.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,the only logical, albeit hard-to-accept conclusion,
Dialogue: 2,0:57:18.96,0:57:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一合理的解释就是
Dialogue: 1,0:57:22.36,0:57:25.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,is that he was able to predict what was going to happen to him.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:22.36,0:57:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他预见自己的未来
Dialogue: 1,0:57:26.08,0:57:29.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,These are memories extracted from Jennings before he fled.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:26.08,0:57:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这是在他逃走之前抽取的记忆
Dialogue: 1,0:57:29.28,0:57:31.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,They don't seem to add up to anything.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:29.28,0:57:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,查不出什么所以然来
Dialogue: 1,0:57:34.24,0:57:36.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Gladys.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:34.24,0:57:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,葛蒂丝
Dialogue: 1,0:57:37.52,0:57:39.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's all for today.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:37.52,0:57:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以走了
Dialogue: 1,0:57:45.32,0:57:48.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,We knew Dekker was trying to design something,
Dialogue: 2,0:57:45.32,0:57:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,戴威廉在设计一样东西
Dialogue: 1,0:57:48.40,0:57:51.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,but when he sold his plans, he wasn't even halfway done.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:48.40,0:57:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他只完成不到一半
Dialogue: 1,0:57:51.84,0:57:52.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:51.84,0:57:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白
Dialogue: 1,0:57:53.04,0:57:56.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Dekker was working at JPL on a laser-enhanced lens.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:53.04,0:57:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他在设计一种雷射镜片
Dialogue: 1,0:57:56.72,0:57:58.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,He claimed the lens was powerful enough
Dialogue: 2,0:57:56.72,0:57:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,据他表示威力强大
Dialogue: 1,0:57:58.36,0:58:01.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,to see around the curvature of the universe.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:58.36,0:58:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,足以看到宇宙的圆弧
Dialogue: 1,0:58:01.84,0:58:05.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Dekker believed that if you could see around a curve that went on forever,
Dialogue: 2,0:58:01.84,0:58:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他相信只要绕过宇宙圆弧
Dialogue: 1,0:58:05.20,0:58:06.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,you would end up back where you started,
Dialogue: 2,0:58:05.20,0:58:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就能绕一圈回到起点
Dialogue: 1,0:58:07.56,0:58:09.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,looking at yourself.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:07.56,0:58:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,看到你自己
Dialogue: 1,0:58:09.24,0:58:12.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,Except you're not looking back at yourself now, in the present.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:09.24,0:58:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,只是你看到的不是现在的你
Dialogue: 1,0:58:12.32,0:58:16.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, you are not. You're looking at the future.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:12.32,0:58:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是 而是未来的你
Dialogue: 1,0:58:16.72,0:58:18.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,Can you imagine what will happen if Jennings figures out
Dialogue: 2,0:58:16.72,0:58:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,如果被詹迈可知道了
Dialogue: 1,0:58:18.80,0:58:20.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,what he's done and tries to profit from it?
Dialogue: 2,0:58:18.80,0:58:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他就能取得暴利
Dialogue: 1,0:58:21.00,0:58:22.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Any nation in the world would give him a king's ransom.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:21.00,0:58:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,很多国家都愿意付高额巨款
Dialogue: 1,0:58:22.92,0:58:25.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Jennings won't do that. I was this close to him. He never lied.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:22.92,0:58:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会这么做\N{\rEng}我问过他话 他都没说谎
Dialogue: 1,0:58:25.96,0:58:28.52,Eng,,0,0,0,,When he heard what he was being accused of, he was hurt and scared.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:25.96,0:58:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他听到我的指控很难过害怕
Dialogue: 1,0:58:28.60,0:58:31.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine, once you bring him in, I'll give him the Medal of Honor.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:28.60,0:58:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那我真该颁给他荣誉奖章
Dialogue: 1,0:58:31.44,0:58:34.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's if Rethrick doesn't find him first.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:31.44,0:58:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他没被雷吉米抓到的话
Dialogue: 1,0:58:40.20,0:58:41.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,You think he really saw the future?
Dialogue: 2,0:58:40.20,0:58:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你想他真的看到未来吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:58:44.28,0:58:45.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,That would be something.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:44.28,0:58:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,一定很不得了
Dialogue: 2,0:59:55.08,0:59:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"米榭餐馆"
Dialogue: 1,0:59:59.52,1:00:00.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,My name is Michael Jennings.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:59.52,1:00:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字是詹迈可
Dialogue: 1,1:00:01.00,1:00:06.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,And I can't remember if I made a reservation there recently.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:01.00,1:00:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我不记得我最近有没有定位
Dialogue: 1,1:00:06.72,1:00:10.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you check that out for me? Thanks.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:06.72,1:00:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,请你帮我查 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,1:00:11.36,1:00:14.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,I did?
Dialogue: 2,1:00:11.36,1:00:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我有吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:00:14.16,1:00:17.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay. Right. How many is it for?
Dialogue: 2,1:00:14.16,1:00:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 一共几位？
Dialogue: 1,1:00:20.40,1:00:23.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, thank you. No, I'll be there.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:20.40,1:00:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不用了 谢谢 我会去
Dialogue: 1,1:00:23.84,1:00:25.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:23.84,1:00:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 1,1:00:46.40,1:00:47.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, you two.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:46.40,1:00:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,哈罗 小鸟儿
Dialogue: 1,1:00:50.88,1:00:52.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,Did he feed you?
Dialogue: 2,1:00:50.88,1:00:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他有没有喂你们？
Dialogue: 1,1:01:15.72,1:01:17.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Rachel, it's Jimmy.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:15.72,1:01:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,蕾秋 我是吉米
Dialogue: 1,1:01:19.08,1:01:21.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,- You all right? - Why?
Dialogue: 2,1:01:19.08,1:01:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？- 为什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:01:23.76,1:01:24.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 2,1:01:23.76,1:01:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:01:26.60,1:01:27.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:26.60,1:01:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 1,1:01:29.60,1:01:30.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,May I come in?
Dialogue: 2,1:01:29.60,1:01:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我能进去吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:01:32.28,1:01:34.84,Eng,,0,0,0,,When was the last time you saw Michael?
Dialogue: 2,1:01:32.28,1:01:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你几时见到迈可？
Dialogue: 1,1:01:34.96,1:01:36.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yesterday morning.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:34.96,1:01:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天早上
Dialogue: 1,1:01:37.08,1:01:39.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,He was pulling an all-nighter at his lab.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:37.08,1:01:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他在实验室熬夜工作
Dialogue: 1,1:01:43.92,1:01:47.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Rachel, I'm sorry to have to be the one to tell you this.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:43.92,1:01:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾我必须告诉你这件事
Dialogue: 1,1:01:47.44,1:01:50.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Michael left AlIcom yesterday. Permanently.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:47.44,1:01:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,迈可昨天永远离开公司了
Dialogue: 1,1:01:54.04,1:01:56.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,- What? - He finished his work.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:54.04,1:01:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 他完成后我们消除他的记忆
Dialogue: 1,1:01:58.28,1:02:01.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,- We erased his memory, and he... - No.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:58.28,1:02:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他完成后我们消除他的记忆 - 不
Dialogue: 1,1:02:01.12,1:02:04.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,- He left. - No. He promised me.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:01.12,1:02:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 然后就走了 - 他答应过我
Dialogue: 1,1:02:04.60,1:02:07.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,He said he wasn't going to go through with it.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:04.60,1:02:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他说他不会这么做
Dialogue: 1,1:02:07.48,1:02:11.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,He made a lot of money on this one, Rachel.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:07.48,1:02:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他这次赚了很多钱
Dialogue: 1,1:02:11.44,1:02:14.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,He said he didn't care about the money.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:11.44,1:02:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他说他不在乎那笔钱
Dialogue: 1,1:02:24.00,1:02:26.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,So she doesn't know anything.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:24.00,1:02:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会把她丢下来
Dialogue: 1,1:02:26.12,1:02:29.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't leave without her. It's Michael. He'd be smart.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:26.12,1:02:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,她什么都不知道 迈可聪明得很
Dialogue: 1,1:02:32.08,1:02:34.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,We're missing something.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:32.08,1:02:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定漏掉什么
Dialogue: 1,1:03:02.40,1:03:05.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,As soon as she leaves for work, get in there.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:02.40,1:03:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,她一去上班就拦住她
Dialogue: 1,1:03:05.12,1:03:06.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,And make sure she can't go anywhere alone.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:05.12,1:03:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,别让她去别的地方
Dialogue: 1,1:03:08.08,1:03:10.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,I want to know what just happened.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:08.08,1:03:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我要知道刚才是怎么回事
Dialogue: 1,1:03:18.20,1:03:20.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Bye, guys.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:18.20,1:03:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 1,1:03:25.12,1:03:27.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,Morning, Dr Porter.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:25.12,1:03:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,早安 博士
Dialogue: 1,1:03:30.92,1:03:32.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,Going somewhere?
Dialogue: 2,1:03:30.92,1:03:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:41.76,1:03:43.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:41.76,1:03:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 1,1:03:47.52,1:03:49.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:47.52,1:03:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 1,1:03:56.92,1:03:59.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm going on top. Take my bag.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:56.92,1:03:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,把我的背包拿去
Dialogue: 1,1:04:01.16,1:04:03.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,- You're gonna need this. - Got it. Thanks.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:01.16,1:04:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你需要这个 - 知道了
Dialogue: 1,1:04:10.12,1:04:11.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Coming?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:10.12,1:04:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你来不来？
Dialogue: 1,1:04:11.76,1:04:14.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, thanks. I'd rather watch from down here.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:11.76,1:04:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不了 我在下面看
Dialogue: 1,1:04:14.36,1:04:15.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:14.36,1:04:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,随你便
Dialogue: 1,1:04:24.48,1:04:25.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, we've been through the bathroom
Dialogue: 2,1:04:24.48,1:04:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,浴室跟公寓
Dialogue: 1,1:04:26.00,1:04:29.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,and tossed the rest of the apartment, too. Zero.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:26.00,1:04:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,都翻遍了什么也没有
Dialogue: 1,1:04:29.44,1:04:31.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,This is what I want you to do. Go back in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:29.44,1:04:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你回去浴室
Dialogue: 1,1:04:45.40,1:04:47.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, start turning left.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:45.40,1:04:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,向左转
Dialogue: 1,1:04:50.20,1:04:52.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you see.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:50.20,1:04:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你看见什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:04:53.24,1:04:54.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,The mirror.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:53.24,1:04:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,镜子
Dialogue: 1,1:05:11.96,1:05:13.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,We've got him.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:11.96,1:05:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,逮到他了
Dialogue: 1,1:05:13.76,1:05:17.30,Eng,,0,0,0,,She's supposed to meet him  Michel, 1:00 pm.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:13.76,1:05:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,她一点要在米榭餐厅见他
Dialogue: 1,1:05:19.16,1:05:20.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's make sure she does.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:19.16,1:05:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要让她去
Dialogue: 2,1:05:46.32,1:05:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,"符合"
Dialogue: 1,1:06:17.60,1:06:19.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm here to meet someone. Michael Jennings.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:17.60,1:06:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我找一位詹迈可
Dialogue: 1,1:06:20.00,1:06:21.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Have a seat. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:20.00,1:06:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 请坐 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,1:06:25.64,1:06:28.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Sit at that table right there.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:25.64,1:06:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,请你坐在那张桌子
Dialogue: 1,1:06:28.40,1:06:31.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,In the seat, with your back to the window.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:28.40,1:06:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,背对着门口
Dialogue: 1,1:06:51.72,1:06:54.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,Michael, thank God you're all right.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:51.72,1:06:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,迈可 你没有事
Dialogue: 1,1:06:54.84,1:06:57.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought I was never gonna see you again.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:54.84,1:06:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为再也见不到你
Dialogue: 1,1:07:01.60,1:07:03.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Michael, it's me.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:01.60,1:07:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,迈可 是我
Dialogue: 1,1:07:05.64,1:07:07.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Rachel.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:05.64,1:07:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,蕾秋
Dialogue: 1,1:07:11.60,1:07:13.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,You can't remember me.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:11.60,1:07:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你不记得我
Dialogue: 1,1:07:16.44,1:07:18.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,No. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:16.44,1:07:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 对不起
Dialogue: 1,1:07:26.56,1:07:31.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,Cops. We can't go in. I'll have to wait for a clear shot.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:26.56,1:07:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,有警察 我不能下手 要等一下
Dialogue: 1,1:07:31.48,1:07:32.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,Maya, stall for time.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:31.48,1:07:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,玛雅 拖延时间
Dialogue: 1,1:07:33.64,1:07:35.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,Tell him you thought he'd remember something.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:33.64,1:07:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他说你以为他会记得
Dialogue: 1,1:07:35.84,1:07:37.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,That you two were engaged.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:35.84,1:07:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩订过婚
Dialogue: 1,1:07:41.20,1:07:43.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess I thought you'd remember something.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:41.20,1:07:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜我以为你会记得
Dialogue: 1,1:07:44.08,1:07:47.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,We've been together for three years.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:44.08,1:07:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在一起三年
Dialogue: 1,1:07:47.44,1:07:50.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:47.44,1:07:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该说什么
Dialogue: 1,1:07:50.64,1:07:52.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:50.64,1:07:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 1,1:07:53.00,1:07:54.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm trying.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:53.00,1:07:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我很努力回想
Dialogue: 1,1:07:57.16,1:07:59.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's how he's doing this.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:57.16,1:07:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是他的工具
Dialogue: 1,1:08:04.28,1:08:08.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen to me very carefully, Maya. This is what I want you to say.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:04.28,1:08:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,仔细听我说 我要你这么跟他说
Dialogue: 1,1:08:09.24,1:08:13.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,Michael, I can see you still have the envelope.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:09.24,1:08:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,迈可 你拿到那个信封
Dialogue: 1,1:08:13.60,1:08:15.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,That means it's working.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:13.60,1:08:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这代表你成功了
Dialogue: 1,1:08:15.36,1:08:18.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,I know you switched the personal items. I helped.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:15.36,1:08:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你把东西掉了包
Dialogue: 1,1:08:18.16,1:08:21.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,- You left me a note on a mirror. - You left me a note on a mirror.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:18.16,1:08:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在镜子上留言 - 你在镜子上留言
Dialogue: 1,1:08:21.48,1:08:22.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to take something from you.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:21.48,1:08:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你要交给我一样东西
Dialogue: 1,1:08:22.68,1:08:23.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to take something.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:22.68,1:08:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你要交给我一样东西
Dialogue: 1,1:08:24.00,1:08:27.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Something I can use to get to Stevens. - Something I can use to get to Stevens.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:24.00,1:08:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让我拿去给史蒂芬 - 让我拿去给史蒂芬
Dialogue: 1,1:08:27.20,1:08:28.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,He's a man you worked with.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:27.20,1:08:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他是你的同事
Dialogue: 1,1:08:28.56,1:08:30.94,Eng,,0,0,0,,- He's a man you worked with. - He's trying to fix the machine.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:28.56,1:08:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他是你的同事 - 他正在修理机器
Dialogue: 1,1:08:31.04,1:08:33.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,He's trying to fix the machine.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:31.04,1:08:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他正在修理机器
Dialogue: 1,1:08:37.40,1:08:39.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Work backwards, Michael.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:37.40,1:08:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你要努力回想
Dialogue: 1,1:08:46.44,1:08:48.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Take the swipe card.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:46.44,1:08:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,把通行证拿走
Dialogue: 1,1:08:49.04,1:08:51.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the swipe card for the campus.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:49.04,1:08:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那是公司的通行证
Dialogue: 1,1:08:51.36,1:08:53.74,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to give that to me.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:51.36,1:08:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你要交给我
Dialogue: 1,1:08:54.92,1:08:58.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Rachel wouldn't be hurt if he hesitated, she'd be impatient.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:54.92,1:08:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,别心急 她很有耐心
Dialogue: 1,1:08:58.20,1:09:01.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, Michael, if you can't trust me right now,
Dialogue: 2,1:08:58.20,1:09:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不相信我
Dialogue: 1,1:09:01.16,1:09:03.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,then we are lost. For good.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:01.16,1:09:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就完了
Dialogue: 1,1:09:03.96,1:09:05.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:03.96,1:09:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 1,1:09:05.88,1:09:07.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:05.88,1:09:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 1,1:09:11.28,1:09:14.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd better get back.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:11.28,1:09:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我要回去了
Dialogue: 1,1:09:14.32,1:09:16.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,They'll get suspicious soon.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:14.32,1:09:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会起疑心
Dialogue: 1,1:09:19.52,1:09:22.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait here. I'll be back in half an hour.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:19.52,1:09:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿等 我半小时后回来
Dialogue: 1,1:09:27.48,1:09:30.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,And don't worry, we end up together.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:27.48,1:09:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,放心 我们最后会在一起
Dialogue: 1,1:09:42.80,1:09:44.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Michael...
Dialogue: 2,1:09:42.80,1:09:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,迈可
Dialogue: 1,1:09:46.92,1:09:48.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:46.92,1:09:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 1,1:10:04.76,1:10:07.32,Eng,,0,0,0,,- What's my favourite baseball team? - What?
Dialogue: 2,1:10:04.76,1:10:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我最喜欢哪支棒球队？- 什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:10:08.68,1:10:11.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,What's my favourite baseball team?
Dialogue: 2,1:10:08.68,1:10:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我最喜欢哪支棒球队？
Dialogue: 1,1:10:13.80,1:10:15.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 2,1:10:13.80,1:10:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这不重要
Dialogue: 1,1:10:27.92,1:10:29.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,That would be the Red Sox.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:27.92,1:10:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是红袜队
Dialogue: 1,1:10:39.20,1:10:41.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,- I think maybe we should go. - Wait!
Dialogue: 2,1:10:39.20,1:10:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们该走了 - 等等
Dialogue: 1,1:10:51.52,1:10:53.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Now we can leave. Come on.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:51.52,1:10:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,可以走了 来吧
Dialogue: 1,1:11:07.84,1:11:10.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait! Hold on.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:07.84,1:11:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 1,1:11:10.32,1:11:11.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,- You have a car? - I might.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:10.32,1:11:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有车吗？- 搞不好有
Dialogue: 1,1:11:11.72,1:11:13.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,You might?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:11.72,1:11:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,搞不好？
Dialogue: 1,1:11:15.52,1:11:17.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,Look for a BMW!
Dialogue: 2,1:11:15.52,1:11:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,找一辆宝马车
Dialogue: 1,1:11:17.80,1:11:19.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,You gotta be joking.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:17.80,1:11:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别开玩笑
Dialogue: 1,1:11:26.96,1:11:28.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Shit! Shit!
Dialogue: 2,1:11:26.96,1:11:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕 糟糕
Dialogue: 1,1:11:30.00,1:11:32.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Let me see that key. - What?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:30.00,1:11:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 钥匙给我看 - 为什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:11:32.72,1:11:34.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're in the wrong section.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:32.72,1:11:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你找错地方了
Dialogue: 1,1:11:35.64,1:11:38.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,Jennings bought the BMW from Southgate Auto on the Internet.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:35.64,1:11:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他在网路买了一台宝马车
Dialogue: 1,1:11:38.32,1:11:40.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,He had the key mailed to him four weeks ago.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:38.32,1:11:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,车钥匙四星期前寄给他
Dialogue: 1,1:11:40.64,1:11:43.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,- What's the colour of his car? - It isn't a car.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:40.64,1:11:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那辆车是什么颜色？- 那不是汽车
Dialogue: 1,1:12:12.24,1:12:15.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,They just turned on Pine. Intercept them on Sixth.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:12.24,1:12:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他转到松街 到六街堵他
Dialogue: 1,1:12:26.60,1:12:29.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,- How good am I on this thing? - You're okay!
Dialogue: 2,1:12:26.60,1:12:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我骑车的技术怎样？- 还可以
Dialogue: 1,1:12:37.96,1:12:42.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Look, I just said you're okay, okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:37.96,1:12:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我只说你还可以 好吗？- 好啦
Dialogue: 1,1:13:15.88,1:13:17.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 2,1:13:15.88,1:13:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧了
Dialogue: 1,1:13:53.84,1:13:56.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Report of shots. Southgate BMW. - Got it.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:53.84,1:13:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 宝马汽车经销商有枪声 - 收到
Dialogue: 1,1:14:28.80,1:14:31.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Stop! I lost the envelope! - What?
Dialogue: 2,1:14:28.80,1:14:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 停车 信封掉了 - 什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:14:34.32,1:14:36.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,- I'll come back and get you. - See you!
Dialogue: 2,1:14:34.32,1:14:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我回来接你 - 待会见
Dialogue: 1,1:15:57.96,1:15:59.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 2,1:15:57.96,1:15:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到了
Dialogue: 1,1:16:10.88,1:16:12.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:10.88,1:16:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 1,1:16:17.72,1:16:19.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,Take us down!
Dialogue: 2,1:16:17.72,1:16:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,飞下去
Dialogue: 1,1:16:19.56,1:16:21.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,Mike, we can help you!
Dialogue: 2,1:16:19.56,1:16:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都知道了
Dialogue: 1,1:16:21.32,1:16:23.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,We know what's going on!
Dialogue: 2,1:16:21.32,1:16:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能帮你
Dialogue: 1,1:16:23.52,1:16:25.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Let us bring you in!
Dialogue: 2,1:16:23.52,1:16:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,快投案吧
Dialogue: 1,1:16:38.40,1:16:41.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,He's headed for the tunnel! Cut him off! Cut him off!
Dialogue: 2,1:16:38.40,1:16:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他想骑进隧道 拦住他
Dialogue: 1,1:17:06.52,1:17:08.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,Duck!
Dialogue: 2,1:17:06.52,1:17:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,低头
Dialogue: 1,1:17:11.20,1:17:12.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,Split!
Dialogue: 2,1:17:11.20,1:17:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,闪
Dialogue: 1,1:17:37.76,1:17:39.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,You think Jennings foresaw that?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:37.76,1:17:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这些他都能预见？
Dialogue: 1,1:17:40.08,1:17:42.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe next time he'll see a nice, quiet stakeout.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:40.08,1:17:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,希望下次没这么刺激
Dialogue: 1,1:18:14.24,1:18:16.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:14.24,1:18:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起
Dialogue: 1,1:18:21.04,1:18:22.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:21.04,1:18:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 1,1:18:22.88,1:18:24.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's all for you anyway.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:22.88,1:18:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,反正是给你的
Dialogue: 1,1:18:27.12,1:18:30.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,I brought you some clothes.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:27.12,1:18:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我带了一些衣服
Dialogue: 1,1:18:31.72,1:18:35.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought you might need them. I hope it's okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:31.72,1:18:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你应该需要吧
Dialogue: 1,1:18:35.24,1:18:36.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:35.24,1:18:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 1,1:18:38.32,1:18:40.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,These are mine?
Dialogue: 2,1:18:38.32,1:18:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:18:42.00,1:18:44.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't remember?
Dialogue: 2,1:18:42.00,1:18:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你不记得了？
Dialogue: 1,1:18:44.32,1:18:45.30,Eng,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:44.32,1:18:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不记得
Dialogue: 1,1:18:53.64,1:18:55.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't remember me, do you?
Dialogue: 2,1:18:53.64,1:18:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你也不记得我 对吧？
Dialogue: 1,1:18:57.48,1:18:58.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 2,1:18:57.48,1:18:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 1,1:19:06.00,1:19:07.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,These are for you.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:06.00,1:19:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这是给你的
Dialogue: 1,1:19:52.12,1:19:56.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you
Dialogue: 2,1:19:52.12,1:19:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你生日快乐
Dialogue: 1,1:19:58.32,1:20:01.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you
Dialogue: 2,1:19:58.32,1:20:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你生日快乐…
Dialogue: 1,1:20:01.36,1:20:02.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're so sweet.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:01.36,1:20:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你真贴心
Dialogue: 1,1:20:22.28,1:20:23.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:22.28,1:20:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 1,1:20:25.24,1:20:26.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:25.24,1:20:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 1,1:20:27.92,1:20:30.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,I just don't remember. I shouldn't have left.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:27.92,1:20:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不记得了 我不该走的
Dialogue: 1,1:20:48.92,1:20:52.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,So you're saying he sent himself a different set of personal items,
Dialogue: 2,1:20:48.92,1:20:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说他把那些东西寄给自己
Dialogue: 1,1:20:52.48,1:20:54.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,ones he'd selected after using the machine,
Dialogue: 2,1:20:52.48,1:20:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他用过机器以后挑选出来
Dialogue: 1,1:20:54.28,1:20:55.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,and nothing our security would flag.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:54.28,1:20:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,可以通过安检的东西
Dialogue: 1,1:20:55.92,1:21:00.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyday things combined with the power of foresight
Dialogue: 2,1:20:55.92,1:21:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这些日常用品加上预知能力
Dialogue: 1,1:21:00.64,1:21:03.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,transform Michael from engineer to escape artist.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:00.64,1:21:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,就让迈可成为脱逃大师
Dialogue: 1,1:21:06.64,1:21:09.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you, but I'd like to return the favour.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:06.64,1:21:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我很想报一箭之仇
Dialogue: 1,1:21:31.96,1:21:34.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Michael, are you okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:21:31.96,1:21:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 1,1:21:39.40,1:21:40.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:39.40,1:21:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 1,1:21:43.48,1:21:46.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,Michael, I don't know what you saw in your machine,
Dialogue: 2,1:21:43.48,1:21:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你用机器看到什么
Dialogue: 1,1:21:46.80,1:21:48.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,but I remember a few weeks ago
Dialogue: 2,1:21:46.80,1:21:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但是几星期前
Dialogue: 1,1:21:48.24,1:21:51.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,you came back from your lab, and you were pale.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:48.24,1:21:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你脸色苍白回来
Dialogue: 1,1:21:51.80,1:21:54.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,You asked me the strangest question.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:51.80,1:21:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,问我一个奇怪的问题
Dialogue: 1,1:21:55.88,1:21:57.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 2,1:21:55.88,1:21:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:21:57.32,1:22:00.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,If I knew it wouldn't work out for you and I
Dialogue: 2,1:21:57.32,1:22:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我知道我们不会有结果
Dialogue: 1,1:22:00.20,1:22:03.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,before we were together, would I have done it?
Dialogue: 2,1:22:00.20,1:22:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我还会跟你交往吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:22:06.04,1:22:08.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 2,1:22:06.04,1:22:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么说？
Dialogue: 1,1:22:08.56,1:22:12.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,That I wouldn't trade our time for anything.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:08.56,1:22:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝对不会后悔
Dialogue: 1,1:22:12.12,1:22:15.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's all we are, the sum of our experiences.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:12.12,1:22:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,人生是经验累积而成
Dialogue: 1,1:22:15.92,1:22:18.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 2,1:22:15.92,1:22:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,况且
Dialogue: 1,1:22:18.32,1:22:21.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,some of the best things in life are total mistakes.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:18.32,1:22:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,最快乐的事通常都是错误
Dialogue: 1,1:22:30.52,1:22:33.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,- What? - You know,
Dialogue: 2,1:22:30.52,1:22:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 你知道的
Dialogue: 1,1:22:34.12,1:22:36.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,when I checked this envelope out at Reddy Grant,
Dialogue: 2,1:22:34.12,1:22:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我在拿到这个信封的时候
Dialogue: 1,1:22:36.48,1:22:40.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,they told me I signed in 20 items, but there were only 19.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:36.48,1:22:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说有二十样东西 可是只有十九样
Dialogue: 1,1:22:40.84,1:22:42.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:40.84,1:22:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白
Dialogue: 1,1:23:34.84,1:23:36.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,What are these pictures of?
Dialogue: 2,1:23:34.84,1:23:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么照片？
Dialogue: 2,1:23:40.88,1:23:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"能预知未来的机器"
Dialogue: 2,1:23:43.40,1:23:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,"世界领袖谴责这项发明"
Dialogue: 1,1:23:50.28,1:23:53.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Michael, look at the rest of the pictures.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:50.28,1:23:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你把照片看完
Dialogue: 2,1:23:57.76,1:24:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,"新发明预见恐怖的未来"
Dialogue: 2,1:24:03.36,1:24:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,"股市一阵恐慌"
Dialogue: 2,1:24:05.40,1:24:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,"爱康集团不跌反涨"
Dialogue: 2,1:24:13.52,1:24:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,"战争 总统下令攻击敌人"
Dialogue: 1,1:24:17.88,1:24:20.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Look at the last one.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:17.88,1:24:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你看最后一则新闻
Dialogue: 1,1:24:26.08,1:24:28.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. It's the future.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:26.08,1:24:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 这就是我们的未来
Dialogue: 1,1:24:30.28,1:24:35.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,The machine predicts a war, and we go to war to avert it.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:30.28,1:24:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,机器预知有战争 我们为了避免战争开战
Dialogue: 1,1:24:35.28,1:24:39.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,It predicts a plague. We herd all the sick together, create a plague.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:35.28,1:24:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,它预知有瘟疫就把病人隔离 于是瘟疫真的爆发
Dialogue: 1,1:24:40.44,1:24:43.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Whatever future this predicts, we make happen.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:40.44,1:24:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,它预知的未来人类就让它发生
Dialogue: 1,1:24:45.08,1:24:48.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,We give over control of our lives completely.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:45.08,1:24:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的生活完全失控
Dialogue: 1,1:24:49.52,1:24:51.82,Eng,,0,0,0,,I did this.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:49.52,1:24:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我一手造成的
Dialogue: 1,1:24:51.92,1:24:54.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Seeing the future will destroy us.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:51.92,1:24:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,预知未来会毁灭世界
Dialogue: 1,1:25:06.20,1:25:08.76,Eng,,0,0,0,,If you show someone their future,
Dialogue: 2,1:25:06.20,1:25:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能看到未来
Dialogue: 1,1:25:08.84,1:25:10.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,they have no future.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:08.84,1:25:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就不会有未来
Dialogue: 1,1:25:12.16,1:25:15.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,You take away the mystety, you take away hope.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:12.16,1:25:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,没有了生命奥秘就会失去希望
Dialogue: 1,1:25:18.52,1:25:21.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,I have to go back. I have to destroy that machine.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:18.52,1:25:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定要回去摧毁那台机器
Dialogue: 1,1:25:21.36,1:25:24.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's impossible. The campus is huge. There are hundreds of guards.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:21.36,1:25:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能 那儿有几百名警卫
Dialogue: 1,1:25:26.04,1:25:28.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,I would not have given up the three years we had together
Dialogue: 2,1:25:26.04,1:25:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会放弃那美好的三年
Dialogue: 1,1:25:28.20,1:25:31.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,unless I was absolutely sure I could get us 50 more.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:28.20,1:25:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,除非我很确定能在一起五十年
Dialogue: 1,1:25:31.56,1:25:33.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay. So how do we get in?
Dialogue: 2,1:25:31.56,1:25:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么进去？
Dialogue: 1,1:25:35.68,1:25:36.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,We don't.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:35.68,1:25:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能跟去
Dialogue: 1,1:25:36.80,1:25:39.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,You said everything was happening for a reason,
Dialogue: 2,1:25:36.80,1:25:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你说一切都有原因
Dialogue: 1,1:25:39.60,1:25:42.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,and that includes me being here.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:39.60,1:25:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这也包括我跟你在一起
Dialogue: 1,1:25:42.64,1:25:44.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,So come on.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:42.64,1:25:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 1,1:25:57.36,1:26:00.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Another day at the most. I don't have many more places to look.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:57.36,1:26:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,最多再过一天我就能找到
Dialogue: 1,1:26:00.88,1:26:03.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess you weren't as smart as you thought, Stevens.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:00.88,1:26:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你没你想像的那么聪明
Dialogue: 1,1:26:03.72,1:26:08.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jennings wouldn't find it any faster unless he knew where to look.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:03.72,1:26:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,詹迈可事先不知道也找不到
Dialogue: 1,1:26:12.44,1:26:15.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,We've got the feeds from mass transit.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:12.44,1:26:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这是监视录影片段
Dialogue: 1,1:26:16.68,1:26:21.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,- He could be anywhere by now. - Except he's not running away.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:16.68,1:26:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他早就逃走了 - 他不会逃走
Dialogue: 1,1:26:21.52,1:26:23.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,He could've given himself a way to disappear,
Dialogue: 2,1:26:21.52,1:26:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他大可以让自己逃得远远的
Dialogue: 1,1:26:23.20,1:26:25.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,but look what he gave himself instead.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:23.20,1:26:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,可是你看他有什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:26:26.08,1:26:29.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,His Alicom security pass.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:26.08,1:26:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,爱康集团的通行证
Dialogue: 1,1:26:29.48,1:26:31.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,He's going back.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:29.48,1:26:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他要回去
Dialogue: 1,1:26:40.96,1:26:44.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's get a warrant to tap the phone and data lines coming out of AlIcom.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:40.96,1:26:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,拦截爱康集团所有通讯
Dialogue: 1,1:26:44.16,1:26:47.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,Put some bodies on that campus. I want that machine!
Dialogue: 2,1:26:44.16,1:26:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,派人潜进去 我要那台机器
Dialogue: 1,1:27:08.92,1:27:12.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Jennings and the girl were spotted. What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 2,1:27:08.92,1:27:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,发现他们了 你要我做什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:27:13.12,1:27:14.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:13.12,1:27:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,什么也别做
Dialogue: 1,1:27:39.16,1:27:41.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Stay where you are.Nobody gets through!
Dialogue: 2,1:27:39.16,1:27:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,站住 不准进来
Dialogue: 1,1:27:41.68,1:27:44.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Sir! - I didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 2,1:27:41.68,1:27:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 先生 - 我什么都没做
Dialogue: 1,1:27:44.56,1:27:46.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Settle down!
Dialogue: 2,1:27:44.56,1:27:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 1,1:27:46.36,1:27:49.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,All the metal detectors on level four just went off at the same time.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:46.36,1:27:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,四楼的警铃全都被触动
Dialogue: 1,1:27:49.40,1:27:50.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Ball bearings.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:49.40,1:27:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,小钢珠
Dialogue: 1,1:28:01.68,1:28:04.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,Just down the hail from the metal detectors.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:01.68,1:28:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他们通过金属探测器
Dialogue: 1,1:28:06.80,1:28:11.66,Eng,,0,0,0,,Pull the guards off the Jennings lab. Let him slip in, think he's fooled us.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:06.80,1:28:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,撤走实验室的警卫 让他以为他偷溜进去
Dialogue: 1,1:28:11.76,1:28:13.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,Once he's fixed the machine, take him.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:11.76,1:28:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,等他修好机器就抓住他
Dialogue: 1,1:28:31.28,1:28:33.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,I built this.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:31.28,1:28:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我设计的
Dialogue: 1,1:28:33.52,1:28:36.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,This door shouldn't be open. There's something wrong.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:33.52,1:28:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这道门不该打开 有点不对劲
Dialogue: 1,1:28:43.32,1:28:47.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,They're expecting us. I'm going to close this door behind us.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:43.32,1:28:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在等我们 把门关起来
Dialogue: 1,1:28:47.28,1:28:49.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Keep it shut.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:47.28,1:28:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,把它关紧
Dialogue: 1,1:28:49.40,1:28:52.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,- He's in. - Confirmed. He's in.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:49.40,1:28:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他进去了 - 确认 他进去了
Dialogue: 1,1:28:52.28,1:28:53.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Great. Once we confirm he's at the machine,
Dialogue: 2,1:28:52.28,1:28:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,等他找到机器
Dialogue: 1,1:28:53.92,1:28:55.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,let's go in after him.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:53.92,1:28:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,就去逮他
Dialogue: 1,1:28:55.28,1:28:57.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought we were gonna wait for him to come out.
Dialogue: 2,1:28:55.28,1:28:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为要等他出来
Dialogue: 1,1:28:58.08,1:29:00.38,Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't wait. Whether it's Jennings or the machine,
Dialogue: 2,1:28:58.08,1:29:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 不管是他或机器
Dialogue: 1,1:29:00.52,1:29:02.90,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't care as long as I get one of them. Let's go!
Dialogue: 2,1:29:00.52,1:29:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我只要得到其中之一就行
Dialogue: 1,1:29:11.68,1:29:13.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,This will do. Watch out.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:11.68,1:29:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来 小心
Dialogue: 1,1:29:13.76,1:29:16.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Whoa! Wait, wait. What are you doing? - Smashing the lock.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:13.76,1:29:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛？- 把门锁砸烂
Dialogue: 1,1:29:16.68,1:29:18.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:16.68,1:29:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 1,1:29:18.92,1:29:23.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,You can't just smash the thing. They'll still be able to get in.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:18.92,1:29:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就算砸烂他们还是进得来
Dialogue: 1,1:29:23.52,1:29:25.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,We gotta jam the outside reader.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:23.52,1:29:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要破坏刷卡机
Dialogue: 1,1:29:43.28,1:29:45.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:43.28,1:29:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 1,1:29:45.60,1:29:49.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at the future before we destroy this thing.
Dialogue: 2,1:29:45.60,1:29:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们先看看未来吧
Dialogue: 1,1:30:48.00,1:30:51.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,I bugged it. I rigged it so Jimmy wouldn't use it against me.
Dialogue: 2,1:30:48.00,1:30:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我放了病毒 不让吉米用来对付我
Dialogue: 1,1:30:51.16,1:30:53.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Then you can fix it, right?
Dialogue: 2,1:30:51.16,1:30:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你能修好 对吧？
Dialogue: 1,1:31:00.44,1:31:03.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, where would I have planted that bug?
Dialogue: 2,1:31:00.44,1:31:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把病毒放在哪儿呢？
Dialogue: 1,1:31:06.52,1:31:09.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe on one of the motherboards.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:06.52,1:31:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,也许放在主机板
Dialogue: 1,1:31:09.20,1:31:14.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, we won't be needing this, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:31:09.20,1:31:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你不必用这玩意吧
Dialogue: 1,1:31:14.12,1:31:16.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,You're dangerous with that thing.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:14.12,1:31:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你太暴力了
Dialogue: 1,1:31:16.24,1:31:17.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,You must have given yourself something to help you find it.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:16.24,1:31:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,一定有什么能帮你找到病毒
Dialogue: 1,1:31:18.08,1:31:19.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it would be.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:18.08,1:31:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道会是什么
Dialogue: 1,1:31:19.68,1:31:22.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,The only things left are the bullet and...this.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:19.68,1:31:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,只剩下子弹跟这玩意
Dialogue: 1,1:31:22.84,1:31:24.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Crossword? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:22.84,1:31:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 猜字游戏？- 对
Dialogue: 1,1:31:28.60,1:31:30.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:28.60,1:31:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 1,1:31:30.72,1:31:33.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Twelve down.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:30.72,1:31:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,往下12
Dialogue: 1,1:31:33.72,1:31:35.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's here.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:33.72,1:31:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是这儿
Dialogue: 1,1:31:41.24,1:31:43.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,Nine, ten, eleven, twelve.\N9 10 11 12
Dialogue: 1,1:31:47.24,1:31:48.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:47.24,1:31:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 1,1:31:49.08,1:31:51.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a circuit diagram.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:49.08,1:31:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,也许这是电路图
Dialogue: 1,1:31:53.80,1:31:56.18,Eng,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have put it in the primary path.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:53.80,1:31:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会放在主路径
Dialogue: 1,1:31:59.92,1:32:01.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Twelve down.
Dialogue: 2,1:31:59.92,1:32:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,往下12
Dialogue: 1,1:32:19.16,1:32:20.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Take him.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:19.16,1:32:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,去抓他
Dialogue: 1,1:32:20.72,1:32:24.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, Corridor 3, Sublevel A,
Dialogue: 2,1:32:20.72,1:32:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,地下A层 第三走道
Dialogue: 1,1:32:24.24,1:32:25.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Jennings' lab.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:24.24,1:32:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,詹迈可的实验室
Dialogue: 1,1:32:35.16,1:32:39.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, let's put this thing to good use one last time.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:35.16,1:32:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,让我好好用这玩意 最后一次
Dialogue: 1,1:32:40.64,1:32:42.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's get us out of here.
Dialogue: 2,1:32:40.64,1:32:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,然后就走人
Dialogue: 1,1:33:29.76,1:33:31.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's in the lab.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:29.76,1:33:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那儿是实验室
Dialogue: 1,1:33:32.84,1:33:34.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's the catwalk.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:32.84,1:33:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那是天桥
Dialogue: 1,1:33:54.48,1:33:59.60,Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, I've changed my future before, using this thing. I can do it again.
Dialogue: 2,1:33:54.48,1:33:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以改变我的未来 现在也可以
Dialogue: 1,1:34:19.40,1:34:20.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,We don't have any more time.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:19.40,1:34:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,没时间了
Dialogue: 1,1:34:20.60,1:34:22.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,We gotta destroy this before they get to it.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:20.60,1:34:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我要毁了它
Dialogue: 1,1:34:22.96,1:34:25.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,WOLFE: Reprogram the door to Jennings' lab, please.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:22.96,1:34:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,重新设定打开实验室大门
Dialogue: 1,1:34:25.80,1:34:27.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:25.80,1:34:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 1,1:34:33.20,1:34:36.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,He must done something to the controller.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:33.20,1:34:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定动了手脚
Dialogue: 1,1:34:37.24,1:34:38.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,How are we gonna get out of here, Michael?
Dialogue: 2,1:34:37.24,1:34:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要怎么逃出去？
Dialogue: 1,1:34:38.68,1:34:40.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:38.68,1:34:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 1,1:35:11.96,1:35:13.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Clear!
Dialogue: 2,1:35:11.96,1:35:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 1,1:35:13.96,1:35:16.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing? - These tanks are liquid hydrogen.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:13.96,1:35:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么？- 这是液态氢
Dialogue: 1,1:35:16.68,1:35:19.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,They're used to cool the machine. They fire in order.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:16.68,1:35:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,用来冷却机器 它们轮流启动
Dialogue: 1,1:35:19.64,1:35:21.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,Number one just fired.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:19.64,1:35:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,一号已经启动了
Dialogue: 1,1:35:21.48,1:35:24.95,Eng,,0,0,0,,When it gets down to number six here, that's all she wrote.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:21.48,1:35:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,等到六号启动 机器就会被炸毁
Dialogue: 1,1:35:26.24,1:35:28.62,Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll see you when this goes off, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:26.24,1:35:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候吉米也完了
Dialogue: 1,1:35:34.80,1:35:36.15,Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 2,1:35:34.80,1:35:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 1,1:35:41.28,1:35:43.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,You see? You judge too soon.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:41.28,1:35:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧 这能派上用场
Dialogue: 1,1:36:01.52,1:36:04.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,They went out through the vent. Spread out and find them.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:01.52,1:36:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们进入通气孔 快给我搜
Dialogue: 1,1:36:34.32,1:36:36.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Position three standing by.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:34.32,1:36:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,第三组待命
Dialogue: 1,1:36:37.52,1:36:39.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:37.52,1:36:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 1,1:36:41.20,1:36:42.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 2,1:36:41.20,1:36:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 1,1:36:51.00,1:36:52.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Look out.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:51.00,1:36:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 1,1:36:55.44,1:36:57.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,Seal off all the exits to the lab.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:55.44,1:36:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,封锁实验室出口
Dialogue: 1,1:37:15.80,1:37:18.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, Jennings,
Dialogue: 2,1:37:15.80,1:37:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 迈可
Dialogue: 1,1:37:18.96,1:37:21.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,let's see what you've been up to.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:18.96,1:37:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看你在搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 1,1:37:36.56,1:37:39.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,Rachel, go for the door, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:37:36.56,1:37:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,蕾秋 往门口跑
Dialogue: 1,1:39:06.28,1:39:07.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,Drop the gun.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:06.28,1:39:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,把枪放下
Dialogue: 1,1:39:11.96,1:39:13.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,Drop the gun.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:11.96,1:39:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,把枪放下
Dialogue: 1,1:39:34.12,1:39:35.10,Eng,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 2,1:39:34.12,1:39:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 1,1:40:06.44,1:40:09.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like Michael's got a date on the catwalks.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:06.44,1:40:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,迈可注定要走上天桥
Dialogue: 1,1:40:14.88,1:40:17.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's make sure he makes it.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:14.88,1:40:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,确定他一定会上去
Dialogue: 1,1:41:35.08,1:41:37.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Let's go. - No, we can't take the catwalk.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:35.08,1:41:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 我们不能走天桥
Dialogue: 1,1:41:37.12,1:41:39.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,I know. We won't, I promise. Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:37.12,1:41:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 不会的 我保证 快走吧
Dialogue: 1,1:41:50.56,1:41:54.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Michael! What are you doing? - Rachel, go, go. I'll distract them.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:50.56,1:41:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛？- 快走吧 我引开他们
Dialogue: 1,1:41:54.12,1:41:55.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Go, please. - No!
Dialogue: 2,1:41:54.12,1:41:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快走 求你了 - 不
Dialogue: 1,1:41:55.52,1:41:58.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen to me. This is my debt. I built this machine.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:55.52,1:41:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 这是我造的孽 我造了这机器
Dialogue: 1,1:41:59.00,1:42:01.51,Eng,,0,0,0,,- I have to pay for it. - No, you come with me now!
Dialogue: 2,1:41:59.00,1:42:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我必须付出代价 - 不 跟我走
Dialogue: 1,1:42:01.60,1:42:06.72,Eng,,0,0,0,,- You promised you'd change your fate! - Please, we don't have time.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:01.60,1:42:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说你会改变命运 - 没时间了
Dialogue: 1,1:42:06.84,1:42:11.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,If you love me, if you care about me, go. Have a good life.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:06.84,1:42:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你爱我的话就快走吧 祝你一生幸福
Dialogue: 1,1:42:14.88,1:42:17.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember me.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:14.88,1:42:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你要记得我
Dialogue: 1,1:42:19.08,1:42:20.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Damn you.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:19.08,1:42:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 1,1:42:27.04,1:42:29.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,Jimmy.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:27.04,1:42:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米
Dialogue: 1,1:42:29.36,1:42:31.66,Eng,,0,0,0,,You want to kill me,
Dialogue: 2,1:42:29.36,1:42:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你想杀我
Dialogue: 1,1:42:31.76,1:42:33.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,come do it yourself.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:31.76,1:42:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,自己来动手吧
Dialogue: 1,1:42:39.08,1:42:41.64,Eng,,0,0,0,,Here I am. You want me? Come get me.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:39.08,1:42:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这儿 想杀我就来呀
Dialogue: 1,1:42:48.08,1:42:49.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Hi, Jimmy. - Hi, Mike.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:48.08,1:42:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 吉米 - 嗨 迈可
Dialogue: 1,1:42:52.44,1:42:54.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Looks like this is it, huh? - Yeah, it is, Mike.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:52.44,1:42:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这就是尽头了 - 没错
Dialogue: 1,1:42:54.96,1:42:57.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,- You only have yourself to blame. - That's a lie.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:54.96,1:42:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你只能怪你自己 - 错了
Dialogue: 1,1:42:57.92,1:43:00.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,You can't change your fate, Mike. You're gonna die today.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:57.92,1:43:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能改变命运 你死定了
Dialogue: 1,1:43:02.36,1:43:03.91,Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:02.36,1:43:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧
Dialogue: 1,1:43:05.04,1:43:07.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,But you're not going to kill me.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:05.04,1:43:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你不会杀我
Dialogue: 1,1:43:13.76,1:43:16.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right, Mike. I've seen the future.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:13.76,1:43:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 我也看到未来
Dialogue: 1,1:44:32.80,1:44:35.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Still think you can change your fate, Mike?
Dialogue: 2,1:44:32.80,1:44:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能改变命运
Dialogue: 1,1:44:37.80,1:44:39.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,I am the future, Mike!
Dialogue: 2,1:44:37.80,1:44:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我才能掌控未来
Dialogue: 1,1:45:06.04,1:45:08.34,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Rethrick has Jennings. - Retire him.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:06.04,1:45:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 雷吉米抓到詹迈可 - 杀了他
Dialogue: 1,1:45:08.44,1:45:10.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,- What? - We have the machine.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:08.44,1:45:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我们拿到机器
Dialogue: 1,1:45:10.48,1:45:14.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,We can't risk its creator falling into the wrong hands. Come on.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:10.48,1:45:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不能让设计者落入坏人手中
Dialogue: 1,1:46:13.92,1:46:16.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't blame me.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:13.92,1:46:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别怪我
Dialogue: 1,1:46:16.88,1:46:20.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,You and Michael would've lived happily ever after, no memory wipe.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:16.88,1:46:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的迈可会选择乖乖听话
Dialogue: 1,1:46:20.60,1:46:22.98,Eng,,0,0,0,,He's the one who saw something he didn't like.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:20.60,1:46:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他却看到他不该看的事
Dialogue: 1,1:46:23.08,1:46:26.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,He's the one who decided he wanted to stop the programme.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:23.08,1:46:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,决定停止这项伟大计划
Dialogue: 1,1:46:42.96,1:46:46.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,Look at it this way, you did change the future, Michael.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:42.96,1:46:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你要这么想 你的确改变了未来
Dialogue: 1,1:46:47.64,1:46:49.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,Before you interfered, you both would've lived,
Dialogue: 2,1:46:47.64,1:46:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你没插手 你就能活命
Dialogue: 1,1:46:49.40,1:46:53.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,we would still be friends, instead of ending up like this.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:49.40,1:46:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也是朋友 而不会有这种结局
Dialogue: 1,1:46:53.88,1:46:56.39,Eng,,0,0,0,,It wasn't meant to be.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:53.88,1:46:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们注定不会成功
Dialogue: 1,1:47:02.36,1:47:04.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,Giving up so easy?
Dialogue: 2,1:47:02.36,1:47:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这么容易就放弃？
Dialogue: 1,1:47:06.72,1:47:09.28,Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you believe in second chances?
Dialogue: 2,1:47:06.72,1:47:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你不相信有第二次机会吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:47:11.68,1:47:14.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, I do.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:11.68,1:47:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,老实说 我相信
Dialogue: 2,1:47:25.44,1:47:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"快跑"
Dialogue: 1,1:47:27.20,1:47:28.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:27.20,1:47:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑…快跑…
Dialogue: 1,1:49:09.84,1:49:11.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:09.84,1:49:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 1,1:49:28.84,1:49:31.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,Any records? Any papers?
Dialogue: 2,1:49:28.84,1:49:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,有任何记录或文件吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:49:31.20,1:49:33.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,Explosion destroyed everything.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:31.20,1:49:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,爆炸毁了一切
Dialogue: 1,1:49:39.68,1:49:40.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Are we trying to salvage that or what?
Dialogue: 2,1:49:39.68,1:49:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们寻找什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:49:40.88,1:49:43.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,Guess we don't get the machine, do we?
Dialogue: 2,1:49:40.88,1:49:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们并没有得到机器
Dialogue: 1,1:50:11.84,1:50:14.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,Any sign of Jennings?
Dialogue: 2,1:50:11.84,1:50:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,詹迈可呢？
Dialogue: 1,1:50:14.68,1:50:17.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,No, I'm afraid he didn't make it.
Dialogue: 2,1:50:14.68,1:50:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他恐怕没活下来
Dialogue: 1,1:51:02.40,1:51:05.07,Eng,,0,0,0,,What was Shorty thinking, starting a nursery?
Dialogue: 2,1:51:02.40,1:51:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,小歪开一间苗圃干嘛？
Dialogue: 1,1:51:05.20,1:51:07.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean, these plants are on life-support.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:05.20,1:51:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这些植物都快挂了
Dialogue: 1,1:51:07.44,1:51:09.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? Really? He told me he had a green thumb.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:07.44,1:51:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他说他很会种花草
Dialogue: 1,1:51:11.12,1:51:13.50,Eng,,0,0,0,,Gangrene is more like it.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:11.12,1:51:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,才怪
Dialogue: 1,1:51:13.60,1:51:16.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,Lucky for Shorty, I'm a biologist.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:13.60,1:51:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好我是生物学家
Dialogue: 1,1:51:16.88,1:51:19.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, lucky for both of us. Since I failed biology,
Dialogue: 2,1:51:16.88,1:51:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我念书时挂掉生物课
Dialogue: 1,1:51:19.92,1:51:23.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,- I'm no help to either one of you. - So you say.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:19.92,1:51:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以帮不上忙 - 真可惜
Dialogue: 1,1:51:23.40,1:51:26.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,Too bad, though, because I'm looking for a partner
Dialogue: 2,1:51:23.40,1:51:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,真糟糕 因为我在找合伙人
Dialogue: 1,1:51:26.96,1:51:29.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,- for a start-up company. Mmm-hmm. - Really? Doing what?
Dialogue: 2,1:51:26.96,1:51:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 新开一家公司 - 是吗？做什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:51:29.72,1:51:31.83,Eng,,0,0,0,,Wanna save the world.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:29.72,1:51:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,拯救世界
Dialogue: 1,1:51:34.76,1:51:36.75,Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm your guy.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:34.76,1:51:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我可没那么大的本事
Dialogue: 1,1:51:36.84,1:51:40.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,But would you settle for someone who wants to help you change it?
Dialogue: 2,1:51:36.84,1:51:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我可以帮你改变世界
Dialogue: 1,1:51:41.28,1:51:43.71,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Okay. - Good.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:41.28,1:51:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 很好
Dialogue: 1,1:51:43.84,1:51:48.03,Eng,,0,0,0,,So how does it end for us, Michael? I mean, what's in our future?
Dialogue: 2,1:51:43.84,1:51:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有什么结果？我们的未来是什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:51:48.12,1:51:53.27,Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, I don't know. I kind of like it that way.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:48.12,1:51:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我比较喜欢这样
Dialogue: 1,1:51:53.36,1:51:56.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,- I do know one thing. - What's that?
Dialogue: 2,1:51:53.36,1:51:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我只知道一件事 - 什么事？
Dialogue: 1,1:51:56.44,1:51:59.31,Eng,,0,0,0,,I never want to forget anything ever again.
Dialogue: 2,1:51:56.44,1:51:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再忘记任何事
Dialogue: 1,1:52:03.16,1:52:06.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,Break it up, break it up. The birdman cometh.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:03.16,1:52:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,别亲了 鸟人来也
Dialogue: 1,1:52:09.44,1:52:10.42,Eng,,0,0,0,,It's dinner.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:09.44,1:52:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,开饭喽
Dialogue: 1,1:52:11.60,1:52:12.87,Eng,,0,0,0,,- You found them. - Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:11.60,1:52:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你找到它们了 - 是啊
Dialogue: 1,1:52:12.96,1:52:14.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Who does everything for everybody around here?
Dialogue: 2,1:52:12.96,1:52:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这个这儿谁最厉害？
Dialogue: 1,1:52:14.72,1:52:15.86,Eng,,0,0,0,,- You do. - You're right.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:14.72,1:52:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你 - 答对了
Dialogue: 1,1:52:15.96,1:52:19.19,Eng,,0,0,0,,- You are my hero. - Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:15.96,1:52:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是大英雄 - 多谢夸奖
Dialogue: 1,1:52:19.28,1:52:22.11,Eng,,0,0,0,,- You hear that? I'm a hero. - That's great.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:19.28,1:52:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听到没？我是大英雄 - 太棒了
Dialogue: 1,1:52:23.32,1:52:25.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,I think I remember. Are those our birds?
Dialogue: 2,1:52:23.32,1:52:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得了 这是我们养的鸟
Dialogue: 1,1:52:25.64,1:52:28.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course they are. We bought them together.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:25.64,1:52:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我们一起买的
Dialogue: 1,1:52:28.76,1:52:32.67,Eng,,0,0,0,,You remember the birds? Well done. You could see into the future
Dialogue: 2,1:52:28.76,1:52:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你记得这些鸟真棒 你能看到未来
Dialogue: 1,1:52:32.80,1:52:35.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,and all you remember are Polly and Tweety there.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:32.80,1:52:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,却只记得这两只傻鸟
Dialogue: 1,1:52:35.72,1:52:38.23,Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't you remember something that would make us rich, huh, Mike?
Dialogue: 2,1:52:35.72,1:52:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么不记得能赚钱的事
Dialogue: 1,1:52:38.32,1:52:40.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,- Wait a second. -  What is it?
Dialogue: 2,1:52:38.32,1:52:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等一下 - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 1,1:52:40.64,1:52:43.47,Eng,,0,0,0,,- I think there was something else. - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:40.64,1:52:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我记得别的东西 - 不
Dialogue: 1,1:52:43.56,1:52:46.43,Eng,,0,0,0,,The envelope's empty. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:43.56,1:52:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,信封是空的 别再想了
Dialogue: 1,1:52:46.52,1:52:49.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold on. I'm working backward here.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:46.52,1:52:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在努力回想
Dialogue: 1,1:52:54.52,1:52:59.35,Eng,,0,0,0,,if you only look where you can't go, you will miss the riches below.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:54.52,1:52:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你只看逃不了的地方 就会错失底下的财富
Dialogue: 1,1:53:03.44,1:53:05.59,Eng,,0,0,0,,I must've known you would never get rid of these birds, right?
Dialogue: 2,1:53:03.44,1:53:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定知道你不会丢掉这些鸟
Dialogue: 1,1:53:05.68,1:53:08.14,Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course not. They're family.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:05.68,1:53:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 它们是一家人
Dialogue: 1,1:53:08.24,1:53:12.79,Eng,,0,0,0,,So I knew this would be here. What only looks where it can't go?
Dialogue: 2,1:53:08.24,1:53:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这一定会在 什么是逃不了的地方？
Dialogue: 1,1:53:12.88,1:53:14.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,A caged bird.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:12.88,1:53:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,鸟笼
Dialogue: 1,1:53:16.84,1:53:19.22,Eng,,0,0,0,,You will miss the riches below.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:16.84,1:53:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你会错失底下的财富
Dialogue: 1,1:53:22.88,1:53:24.55,Eng,,0,0,0,,The riches below.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:22.88,1:53:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,底下的财富
Dialogue: 2,1:53:32.04,1:53:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"头奖奖金九千万元"
Dialogue: 1,1:53:33.68,1:53:35.63,Eng,,0,0,0,,What is that?
