Dialogue: 2,1:53:48.32,1:53:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道什么
Dialogue: 1,1:53:49.64,1:53:52.99,Eng,,0,0,0,,I think now's probably a good time to discuss my commission, 33%.
Dialogue: 2,1:53:49.64,1:53:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我要抽百分之三十三的佣金
